window.ESSAY_DATA = {"articles":[{"id":"cet4-01","level":"CET4","number":1,"title":"采取行动","titleEn":"The Importance of Taking Action","genre":"议论文 · 重要性","sentences":[{"en":"Nowadays, it is widely acknowledged that taking action plays a vital role in personal growth.","zh":"如今，人们普遍认为，采取行动在个人成长中起着至关重要的作用。","section":"引出话题 + 立论","targets":["it is widely acknowledged that","plays a vital role in"]},{"en":"Many people admire those who achieve great things, yet few realize that behind every success lie countless small steps taken without delay.","zh":"许多人羡慕成就大事的人，却很少意识到，每次成功背后都有无数及时迈出的小步。","section":"引出话题 + 立论","targets":["behind every success lie","countless small steps taken without delay"]},{"en":"To begin with, action turns plans into reality.","zh":"首先，行动把计划转化为现实。","section":"论点一：计划变现实","targets":["turns plans into reality"]},{"en":"A good idea, however brilliant, remains useless until it is put into practice.","zh":"一个好想法，无论多么出色，在付诸实践之前仍然毫无用处。","section":"论点一：计划变现实","targets":["however brilliant","is put into practice"]},{"en":"Furthermore, taking action builds confidence.","zh":"此外，采取行动能够建立信心。","section":"论点二：建立信心 + 对比","targets":["builds confidence","taking action builds"]},{"en":"Every time we complete a small task, we trust ourselves a little more, which encourages us to take on greater challenges.","zh":"每完成一项小任务，我们就更相信自己一点，这会鼓励我们迎接更大的挑战。","section":"论点二：建立信心 + 对比","targets":["Every time we","which encourages us"]},{"en":"By contrast, those who keep waiting for the \"perfect moment\" often end up achieving nothing.","zh":"相比之下，那些一直等待“完美时机”的人往往最终一事无成。","section":"论点二：建立信心 + 对比","targets":["keep waiting for","end up achieving nothing"]},{"en":"Admittedly, taking action requires courage, for we may fail along the way.","zh":"诚然，采取行动需要勇气，因为我们可能会在过程中失败。","section":"让步 + 转折","targets":["requires courage","for we may fail"]},{"en":"But failure itself is a valuable lesson that no amount of thinking can ever provide.","zh":"但失败本身就是宝贵的一课，这是再多的思考也无法提供的。","section":"让步 + 转折","targets":["no amount of thinking","a valuable lesson"]},{"en":"In conclusion, action is the bridge between dreams and reality.","zh":"总之，行动是连接梦想与现实的桥梁。","section":"总结升华","targets":["the bridge between dreams and reality"]},{"en":"Only by taking the first step can we move closer to our goals.","zh":"只有迈出第一步，我们才能更接近目标。","section":"总结升华","targets":["Only by taking the first step","move closer to our goals"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"Nowadays, it is widely acknowledged that taking action plays a vital role in personal growth. Many people admire those who achieve great things, yet few realize that behind every success lie countless small steps taken without delay.","zh":"如今，人们普遍认为，采取行动在个人成长中起着至关重要的作用。许多人羡慕成就大事的人，却很少意识到，每次成功背后都有无数及时迈出的小步。"},{"en":"To begin with, action turns plans into reality. A good idea, however brilliant, remains useless until it is put into practice. Furthermore, taking action builds confidence. Every time we complete a small task, we trust ourselves a little more, which encourages us to take on greater challenges. By contrast, those who keep waiting for the \"perfect moment\" often end up achieving nothing.","zh":"首先，行动把计划转化为现实。一个好想法，无论多么出色，在付诸实践之前仍然毫无用处。此外，采取行动能够建立信心。每完成一项小任务，我们就更相信自己一点，这会鼓励我们迎接更大的挑战。相比之下，那些一直等待“完美时机”的人往往最终一事无成。"},{"en":"Admittedly, taking action requires courage, for we may fail along the way. But failure itself is a valuable lesson that no amount of thinking can ever provide.","zh":"诚然，采取行动需要勇气，因为我们可能会在过程中失败。但失败本身就是宝贵的一课，这是再多的思考也无法提供的。"},{"en":"In conclusion, action is the bridge between dreams and reality. Only by taking the first step can we move closer to our goals.","zh":"总之，行动是连接梦想与现实的桥梁。只有迈出第一步，我们才能更接近目标。"}],"structure":[{"label":"成功靠小步","summary":"成长 → 成功背后","keywords":["personal growth","small steps","without delay"]},{"label":"实践与信心","summary":"计划落地 → 小任务 → 挑战；拖延对比","keywords":["into reality","builds confidence","perfect moment"]},{"label":"失败也是课","summary":"勇气 → 失败 → 宝贵经验","keywords":["requires courage","fail","valuable lesson"]},{"label":"迈出第一步","summary":"桥梁 → 梦想现实 → 接近目标","keywords":["the bridge","first step","our goals"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet4-01-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet4-01-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-01-01.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659},{"id":"cet4-01-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet4-01-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-01-02.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1619},{"id":"cet4-01-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet4-01-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-01-03.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1620},{"id":"cet4-01-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet4-01-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-01-04.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1619}],"keywords":["it is widely acknowledged that","plays a vital role in","behind every success lie","countless small steps taken without delay","turns plans into reality","however brilliant","is put into practice","builds confidence","taking action builds","Every time we","which encourages us","keep waiting for"],"transferTip":"以上均为迁移练习片段。先换话题词，再重写理由与风险；是非题还需明确支持或反对。"},{"id":"cet4-02","level":"CET4","number":2,"title":"阅读文学","titleEn":"The Importance of Reading Literature","genre":"议论文 · 学习与技能","sentences":[{"en":"In an age dominated by short videos and social media, reading literature may seem old-fashioned.","zh":"在短视频和社交媒体主导的时代，阅读文学作品或许显得过时。","section":"背景 + 立论","targets":["seem old-fashioned","short videos and social media"]},{"en":"However, I firmly believe that reading literary works remains one of the most rewarding habits a college student can develop.","zh":"然而，我坚信，阅读文学作品仍然是大学生能够养成的最有价值的习惯之一。","section":"背景 + 立论","targets":["I firmly believe that","one of the most rewarding habits"]},{"en":"First of all, literature broadens our horizons.","zh":"首先，文学开阔我们的视野。","section":"论点一：开阔视野","targets":["broadens our horizons"]},{"en":"Through novels and poems, we experience lives and cultures far beyond our own, which deepens our understanding of the world.","zh":"通过小说和诗歌，我们体验远超自身生活范围的人生与文化，从而加深对世界的理解。","section":"论点一：开阔视野","targets":["far beyond our own","Through novels and poems"]},{"en":"In addition, it sharpens our language skills.","zh":"此外，它提升我们的语言能力。","section":"论点二、三：语言 + 同理心","targets":["sharpens our language skills"]},{"en":"Constant exposure to well-crafted sentences enriches our vocabulary and improves our writing.","zh":"持续接触精心写成的句子，能够丰富我们的词汇并改善写作。","section":"论点二、三：语言 + 同理心","targets":["Constant exposure to","enriches our vocabulary"]},{"en":"Moreover, reading literature cultivates empathy, as we learn to see things from the characters' point of view.","zh":"而且，阅读文学培养同理心，因为我们会学习从人物的角度看待事情。","section":"论点二、三：语言 + 同理心","targets":["from the characters' point of view","cultivates empathy"]},{"en":"Some may argue that literature is impractical.","zh":"有些人可能认为文学不实用。","section":"让步 + 反驳","targets":["Some may argue that"]},{"en":"Yet its value lies not in immediate utility but in lifelong influence.","zh":"然而，它的价值不在于即时用途，而在于终身影响。","section":"让步 + 反驳","targets":["lies not in","not in immediate utility but in lifelong influence"]},{"en":"Therefore, we should set aside time to read every day.","zh":"因此，我们应该每天留出时间阅读。","section":"行动号召","targets":["set aside time to read"]},{"en":"Even fifteen minutes a day can make a difference in the long run.","zh":"即使每天只有十五分钟，从长远看也能带来改变。","section":"行动号召","targets":["make a difference","in the long run"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"In an age dominated by short videos and social media, reading literature may seem old-fashioned. However, I firmly believe that reading literary works remains one of the most rewarding habits a college student can develop.","zh":"在短视频和社交媒体主导的时代，阅读文学作品或许显得过时。然而，我坚信，阅读文学作品仍然是大学生能够养成的最有价值的习惯之一。"},{"en":"First of all, literature broadens our horizons. Through novels and poems, we experience lives and cultures far beyond our own, which deepens our understanding of the world. In addition, it sharpens our language skills. Constant exposure to well-crafted sentences enriches our vocabulary and improves our writing. Moreover, reading literature cultivates empathy, as we learn to see things from the characters' point of view.","zh":"首先，文学开阔我们的视野。通过小说和诗歌，我们体验远超自身生活范围的人生与文化，从而加深对世界的理解。此外，它提升我们的语言能力。持续接触精心写成的句子，能够丰富我们的词汇并改善写作。而且，阅读文学培养同理心，因为我们会学习从人物的角度看待事情。"},{"en":"Some may argue that literature is impractical. Yet its value lies not in immediate utility but in lifelong influence.","zh":"有些人可能认为文学不实用。然而，它的价值不在于即时用途，而在于终身影响。"},{"en":"Therefore, we should set aside time to read every day. Even fifteen minutes a day can make a difference in the long run.","zh":"因此，我们应该每天留出时间阅读。即使每天只有十五分钟，从长远看也能带来改变。"}],"structure":[{"label":"时代与立场","summary":"短视频时代 → 看似过时 → 仍有价值","keywords":["short videos","old-fashioned","rewarding habits"]},{"label":"三层阅读价值","summary":"看得广 → 写得好 → 懂他人","keywords":["broadens horizons","language skills","cultivates empathy"]},{"label":"价值看长远","summary":"不实用？→ 即时用途与终身影响","keywords":["impractical","immediate utility","lifelong influence"]},{"label":"每日十五分钟","summary":"留出时间 → 小投入 → 长期改变","keywords":["set aside time","fifteen minutes","long run"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet4-02-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet4-02-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-02-01.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1619},{"id":"cet4-02-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet4-02-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-02-02.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1619},{"id":"cet4-02-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet4-02-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-02-03.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1619},{"id":"cet4-02-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet4-02-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-02-04.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659}],"keywords":["seem old-fashioned","short videos and social media","I firmly believe that","one of the most rewarding habits","broadens our horizons","far beyond our own","Through novels and poems","sharpens our language skills","Constant exposure to","enriches our vocabulary","from the characters' point of view","cultivates empathy"],"transferTip":"以上均为迁移练习片段。学习类主题可沿用价值链，但每项理由都要配与新技能相符的具体解释。"},{"id":"cet4-03","level":"CET4","number":3,"title":"健康大学生活","titleEn":"Developing a Healthy Lifestyle in College","genre":"议论文 · 校园生活","sentences":[{"en":"College life offers students unprecedented freedom, but it also brings the temptation to stay up late, skip meals and live a sedentary life.","zh":"大学生活给予学生前所未有的自由，但也带来熬夜、漏餐和久坐生活的诱惑。","section":"现象 + 立论","targets":["the temptation to","unprecedented freedom"]},{"en":"Therefore, developing a healthy lifestyle is of great importance to every college student.","zh":"因此，养成健康的生活方式对每位大学生都非常重要。","section":"现象 + 立论","targets":["is of great importance to","developing a healthy lifestyle"]},{"en":"To begin with, good health is the foundation of academic success.","zh":"首先，良好健康是学业成功的基础。","section":"论点一：支撑学业","targets":["the foundation of academic success"]},{"en":"Students who eat properly and exercise regularly can concentrate better and are less likely to fall ill during exam periods.","zh":"合理饮食并经常锻炼的学生能够更好地集中注意力，也更不容易在考试期间生病。","section":"论点一：支撑学业","targets":["are less likely to fall ill","eat properly and exercise regularly"]},{"en":"Furthermore, a healthy lifestyle helps regulate our emotions.","zh":"此外，健康生活方式有助于调节我们的情绪。","section":"论点二：调节情绪","targets":["helps regulate our emotions"]},{"en":"Physical activity releases pressure and keeps us in a positive mood, which is especially valuable when we face stress.","zh":"体育活动释放压力并让我们保持积极情绪，这在我们面临压力时尤其宝贵。","section":"论点二：调节情绪","targets":["keeps us in a positive mood","releases pressure"]},{"en":"How, then, can we build such a lifestyle?","zh":"那么，我们该怎样建立这样的生活方式呢？","section":"给出做法","targets":["How, then, can we","build such a lifestyle"]},{"en":"We may start with simple habits: going to bed before midnight, exercising three times a week, and eating regular meals.","zh":"我们可以从简单习惯开始：午夜前睡觉，每周锻炼三次，以及按时吃饭。","section":"给出做法","targets":["start with simple habits","going to bed before midnight"]},{"en":"In short, health is the greatest wealth a college student can possess.","zh":"简言之，健康是大学生能够拥有的最宝贵的财富。","section":"总结升华","targets":["the greatest wealth","wealth a college student can possess"]},{"en":"Only with a sound body can we pursue our dreams wholeheartedly.","zh":"只有拥有健康的身体，我们才能全心全意地追求梦想。","section":"总结升华","targets":["pursue our dreams wholeheartedly","Only with a sound body"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"College life offers students unprecedented freedom, but it also brings the temptation to stay up late, skip meals and live a sedentary life. Therefore, developing a healthy lifestyle is of great importance to every college student.","zh":"大学生活给予学生前所未有的自由，但也带来熬夜、漏餐和久坐生活的诱惑。因此，养成健康的生活方式对每位大学生都非常重要。"},{"en":"To begin with, good health is the foundation of academic success. Students who eat properly and exercise regularly can concentrate better and are less likely to fall ill during exam periods. Furthermore, a healthy lifestyle helps regulate our emotions. Physical activity releases pressure and keeps us in a positive mood, which is especially valuable when we face stress.","zh":"首先，良好健康是学业成功的基础。合理饮食并经常锻炼的学生能够更好地集中注意力，也更不容易在考试期间生病。此外，健康生活方式有助于调节我们的情绪。体育活动释放压力并让我们保持积极情绪，这在我们面临压力时尤其宝贵。"},{"en":"How, then, can we build such a lifestyle? We may start with simple habits: going to bed before midnight, exercising three times a week, and eating regular meals.","zh":"那么，我们该怎样建立这样的生活方式呢？我们可以从简单习惯开始：午夜前睡觉，每周锻炼三次，以及按时吃饭。"},{"en":"In short, health is the greatest wealth a college student can possess. Only with a sound body can we pursue our dreams wholeheartedly.","zh":"简言之，健康是大学生能够拥有的最宝贵的财富。只有拥有健康的身体，我们才能全心全意地追求梦想。"}],"structure":[{"label":"自由也有诱惑","summary":"自由 → 熬夜漏餐久坐 → 需要健康","keywords":["freedom","temptation","healthy lifestyle"]},{"label":"学业与情绪","summary":"专注少病 → 减压 → 积极心情","keywords":["academic success","regulate emotions","positive mood"]},{"label":"三项小习惯","summary":"怎么做？→ 早睡 → 运动 → 按时吃饭","keywords":["before midnight","three times","regular meals"]},{"label":"健康支撑追梦","summary":"财富 → 健全体魄 → 全心追梦","keywords":["greatest wealth","sound body","pursue dreams"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet4-03-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet4-03-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-03-01.thumb.webp","width":972,"height":1619},{"id":"cet4-03-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet4-03-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-03-02.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659},{"id":"cet4-03-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet4-03-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-03-03.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659},{"id":"cet4-03-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet4-03-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-03-04.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1660}],"keywords":["the temptation to","unprecedented freedom","is of great importance to","developing a healthy lifestyle","the foundation of academic success","are less likely to fall ill","eat properly and exercise regularly","helps regulate our emotions","keeps us in a positive mood","releases pressure","How, then, can we","build such a lifestyle"],"transferTip":"以上均为迁移练习片段。校园主题先确定问题，再选两项真实好处，最后给出具体、容易执行的建议。"},{"id":"cet4-04","level":"CET4","number":4,"title":"辨别网络真假信息","titleEn":"Distinguishing True and False Information Online","genre":"议论文 · 科技与信息","sentences":[{"en":"We are now living in an age of information explosion.","zh":"我们正生活在一个信息爆炸的时代。","section":"背景 + 立论","targets":["an age of information explosion"]},{"en":"While the Internet gives us easy access to knowledge, it also floods us with rumors and fake news.","zh":"虽然互联网使我们可以轻松获取知识，但它也让谣言和假新闻大量涌向我们。","section":"背景 + 立论","targets":["gives us easy access to knowledge","floods us with rumors and fake news"]},{"en":"Therefore, the ability to tell true information from false has become essential for college students.","zh":"因此，辨别信息真伪的能力已经成为大学生的必备能力。","section":"背景 + 立论","targets":["tell true information from false","has become essential for"]},{"en":"To begin with, false information can lead us to make wrong decisions.","zh":"首先，虚假信息会导致我们作出错误决定。","section":"危害一 + 举例","targets":["lead us to make wrong decisions"]},{"en":"For instance, misleading health advice may do harm to our bodies, and fake recruitment advertisements may cheat us out of money.","zh":"例如，误导性的健康建议可能损害我们的身体，虚假招聘广告可能骗走我们的钱财。","section":"危害一 + 举例","targets":["do harm to our bodies","cheat us out of money"]},{"en":"Furthermore, those who cannot judge information critically are easily misled by emotion and may spread rumors without even realizing it.","zh":"此外，不能批判性地判断信息的人很容易被情绪误导，并且可能在毫无察觉的情况下传播谣言。","section":"危害二","targets":["judge information critically","are easily misled by emotion"]},{"en":"How, then, can we improve this ability?","zh":"那么，我们怎样才能提高这种能力呢？","section":"给出做法","targets":["How, then, can we"]},{"en":"First, always check the source of the information.","zh":"第一，始终核查信息来源。","section":"给出做法","targets":["check the source"]},{"en":"Second, compare reports from several reliable platforms.","zh":"第二，比较几个可靠平台的报道。","section":"给出做法","targets":["reliable platforms","compare reports"]},{"en":"Third, keep a calm mind and question anything that sounds too shocking.","zh":"第三，保持冷静，质疑一切听起来过于耸人听闻的信息。","section":"给出做法","targets":["keep a calm mind","question anything that sounds too shocking"]},{"en":"In conclusion, distinguishing true from false information is not a luxury but a necessity in the digital age.","zh":"总之，在数字时代，辨别信息真伪并非一种奢侈的能力，而是一项必备能力。","section":"总结","targets":["not a luxury but a necessity","distinguishing true from false information"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"We are now living in an age of information explosion. While the Internet gives us easy access to knowledge, it also floods us with rumors and fake news. Therefore, the ability to tell true information from false has become essential for college students.","zh":"我们正生活在一个信息爆炸的时代。虽然互联网使我们可以轻松获取知识，但它也让谣言和假新闻大量涌向我们。因此，辨别信息真伪的能力已经成为大学生的必备能力。"},{"en":"To begin with, false information can lead us to make wrong decisions. For instance, misleading health advice may do harm to our bodies, and fake recruitment advertisements may cheat us out of money. Furthermore, those who cannot judge information critically are easily misled by emotion and may spread rumors without even realizing it.","zh":"首先，虚假信息会导致我们作出错误决定。例如，误导性的健康建议可能损害我们的身体，虚假招聘广告可能骗走我们的钱财。此外，不能批判性地判断信息的人很容易被情绪误导，并且可能在毫无察觉的情况下传播谣言。"},{"en":"How, then, can we improve this ability? First, always check the source of the information. Second, compare reports from several reliable platforms. Third, keep a calm mind and question anything that sounds too shocking.","zh":"那么，我们怎样才能提高这种能力呢？第一，始终核查信息来源。第二，比较几个可靠平台的报道。第三，保持冷静，质疑一切听起来过于耸人听闻的信息。"},{"en":"In conclusion, distinguishing true from false information is not a luxury but a necessity in the digital age.","zh":"总之，在数字时代，辨别信息真伪并非一种奢侈的能力，而是一项必备能力。"}],"structure":[{"label":"01 信息环境","summary":"互联网既带来什么便利，又带来什么问题？为什么要辨别？","keywords":["information explosion","easy access","essential ability"]},{"label":"02 两种危害","summary":"先想个人决策，再想情绪误导与谣言传播；健康、招聘作例子。","keywords":["wrong decisions","health advice","spread rumors"]},{"label":"03 三项做法","summary":"问「怎么提高」后，按来源 → 平台 → 心态检索。","keywords":["check the source","compare reports","keep calm"]},{"label":"04 重申必要","summary":"用「不是奢侈品，而是必需品」收束数字时代的能力需求。","keywords":["true and false","not a luxury","a necessity"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet4-04-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet4-04-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-04-01.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659},{"id":"cet4-04-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet4-04-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-04-02.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659},{"id":"cet4-04-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet4-04-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-04-03.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659},{"id":"cet4-04-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet4-04-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-04-04.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659}],"keywords":["an age of information explosion","gives us easy access to knowledge","floods us with rumors and fake news","tell true information from false","has become essential for","lead us to make wrong decisions","do harm to our bodies","cheat us out of money","judge information critically","are easily misled by emotion","How, then, can we","check the source"],"transferTip":"先审清任务是谈重要性还是给做法；每个新话题都重新确定风险、例子和措施，示例仅作练句。"},{"id":"cet4-05","level":"CET4","number":5,"title":"团队合作的重要性","titleEn":"The Importance of Teamwork","genre":"议论文 · 人际与合作","sentences":[{"en":"In today's society, few abilities are as valuable as the ability to work with others.","zh":"在当今社会，很少有能力像与他人合作的能力一样宝贵。","section":"立论","targets":["few abilities are as valuable as","work with others"]},{"en":"As the job market becomes increasingly competitive, teamwork has become a key factor in both personal growth and organizational success.","zh":"随着就业市场的竞争日益激烈，团队合作已成为个人成长和组织成功的一个关键因素。","section":"立论","targets":["a key factor in","both personal growth and organizational success"]},{"en":"To begin with, teamwork pools different strengths.","zh":"首先，团队合作汇聚不同的优势。","section":"论点一","targets":["pools different strengths"]},{"en":"No individual, however talented, can handle every task alone, whereas a well-organized team can achieve far more than the sum of its members.","zh":"任何个人，无论多么有才华，都无法独自处理每一项任务；而一个组织良好的团队能够取得远超过成员简单相加的成果。","section":"论点一","targets":["however talented","far more than the sum of its members"]},{"en":"Furthermore, cooperation cultivates mutual understanding.","zh":"此外，合作培养相互理解。","section":"论点二","targets":["cultivates mutual understanding"]},{"en":"When people with different backgrounds work together, they learn to listen and to compromise, which creates a pleasant atmosphere for everyone.","zh":"当来自不同背景的人一起工作时，他们会学会倾听和妥协，从而为每个人营造愉快的氛围。","section":"论点二","targets":["learn to listen and to compromise","which creates a pleasant atmosphere"]},{"en":"Admittedly, conflicts may arise within a team.","zh":"诚然，团队内部可能产生冲突。","section":"让步 + 解决","targets":["conflicts may arise"]},{"en":"Yet they can be resolved through honest communication and mutual respect.","zh":"然而，这些冲突可以通过坦诚沟通和相互尊重来解决。","section":"让步 + 解决","targets":["can be resolved through","honest communication and mutual respect"]},{"en":"In short, teamwork benefits both the individual and the organization.","zh":"总之，团队合作既有利于个人，也有利于组织。","section":"总结 + 落点","targets":["benefits both the individual and the organization"]},{"en":"Students who develop this ability early will be better prepared for their future careers.","zh":"尽早培养这种能力的学生将能为未来的职业生涯作更充分的准备。","section":"总结 + 落点","targets":["develop this ability early","be better prepared for"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"In today's society, few abilities are as valuable as the ability to work with others. As the job market becomes increasingly competitive, teamwork has become a key factor in both personal growth and organizational success.","zh":"在当今社会，很少有能力像与他人合作的能力一样宝贵。随着就业市场的竞争日益激烈，团队合作已成为个人成长和组织成功的一个关键因素。"},{"en":"To begin with, teamwork pools different strengths. No individual, however talented, can handle every task alone, whereas a well-organized team can achieve far more than the sum of its members. Furthermore, cooperation cultivates mutual understanding. When people with different backgrounds work together, they learn to listen and to compromise, which creates a pleasant atmosphere for everyone.","zh":"首先，团队合作汇聚不同的优势。任何个人，无论多么有才华，都无法独自处理每一项任务；而一个组织良好的团队能够取得远超过成员简单相加的成果。此外，合作培养相互理解。当来自不同背景的人一起工作时，他们会学会倾听和妥协，从而为每个人营造愉快的氛围。"},{"en":"Admittedly, conflicts may arise within a team. Yet they can be resolved through honest communication and mutual respect.","zh":"诚然，团队内部可能产生冲突。然而，这些冲突可以通过坦诚沟通和相互尊重来解决。"},{"en":"In short, teamwork benefits both the individual and the organization. Students who develop this ability early will be better prepared for their future careers.","zh":"总之，团队合作既有利于个人，也有利于组织。尽早培养这种能力的学生将能为未来的职业生涯作更充分的准备。"}],"structure":[{"label":"01 合作价值","summary":"能力很宝贵；就业竞争把个人成长与组织成功连在一起。","keywords":["work with others","job market","a key factor"]},{"label":"02 双重理由","summary":"先想优势互补，再想倾听妥协；各写一个解释句。","keywords":["different strengths","mutual understanding","listen and compromise"]},{"label":"03 冲突回应","summary":"承认团队会有冲突；用什么方式化解？","keywords":["conflicts may arise","honest communication","mutual respect"]},{"label":"04 未来落点","summary":"总结谁受益，再说学生尽早培养对未来职业有何帮助。","keywords":["individual and organization","develop early","future careers"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet4-05-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet4-05-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-05-01.thumb.webp","width":1024,"height":1536},{"id":"cet4-05-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet4-05-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-05-02.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1619},{"id":"cet4-05-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet4-05-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-05-03.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1619},{"id":"cet4-05-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet4-05-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-05-04.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1620}],"keywords":["few abilities are as valuable as","work with others","a key factor in","both personal growth and organizational success","pools different strengths","however talented","far more than the sum of its members","cultivates mutual understanding","learn to listen and to compromise","which creates a pleasant atmosphere","conflicts may arise","can be resolved through"],"transferTip":"题目问「重要性」就论证价值；问「如何做」就提出可执行建议，避免仅替换核心名词。"},{"id":"cet4-06","level":"CET4","number":6,"title":"建设绿色校园","titleEn":"Building a Green Campus","genre":"议论文 · 环保","sentences":[{"en":"As environmental problems become increasingly serious, the idea of green development has gained wide attention.","zh":"随着环境问题日益严重，绿色发展的理念已受到广泛关注。","section":"背景 + 立论","targets":["become increasingly serious","has gained wide attention"]},{"en":"For college students, building a green campus is not merely a slogan but a practical responsibility we should take seriously.","zh":"对大学生而言，建设绿色校园不仅仅是一句口号，更是一项我们应该认真对待的实际责任。","section":"背景 + 立论","targets":["building a green campus","not merely a slogan but a practical responsibility"]},{"en":"To begin with, a green campus benefits everyone living on it.","zh":"首先，绿色校园使生活在其中的每个人受益。","section":"意义一","targets":["benefits everyone living on it"]},{"en":"Saving electricity, reducing waste and planting more trees create a cleaner and healthier environment for study and life.","zh":"节约用电、减少浪费和种植更多树木，能为学习和生活创造更清洁、更健康的环境。","section":"意义一","targets":["a cleaner and healthier environment","Saving electricity, reducing waste and planting more trees"]},{"en":"Furthermore, such practices shape our daily habits.","zh":"此外，这些做法塑造我们的日常习惯。","section":"意义二","targets":["shape our daily habits"]},{"en":"Students who learn to recycle paper or turn off the lights before leaving will carry these habits into their future careers.","zh":"学会回收纸张或离开前关灯的学生，会把这些习惯带入未来的职业生活。","section":"意义二","targets":["turn off the lights","recycle paper"]},{"en":"Finally, a green campus can set an example for society, encouraging more people to join the effort.","zh":"最后，绿色校园能够为社会树立榜样，鼓励更多人参与这项努力。","section":"意义三","targets":["set an example for society","encouraging more people to join the effort"]},{"en":"Therefore, we should start with small actions: bringing our own water bottles, using both sides of the paper, and refusing unnecessary plastic bags.","zh":"因此，我们应该从小事做起：自带水瓶、使用纸张的两面，以及拒绝不必要的塑料袋。","section":"做法","targets":["start with small actions","using both sides of the paper"]},{"en":"In short, protecting the environment begins at home — and the campus is our home.","zh":"总之，保护环境始于自己的家园——而校园就是我们的家园。","section":"收尾","targets":["the campus is our home","begins at home"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"As environmental problems become increasingly serious, the idea of green development has gained wide attention. For college students, building a green campus is not merely a slogan but a practical responsibility we should take seriously.","zh":"随着环境问题日益严重，绿色发展的理念已受到广泛关注。对大学生而言，建设绿色校园不仅仅是一句口号，更是一项我们应该认真对待的实际责任。"},{"en":"To begin with, a green campus benefits everyone living on it. Saving electricity, reducing waste and planting more trees create a cleaner and healthier environment for study and life. Furthermore, such practices shape our daily habits. Students who learn to recycle paper or turn off the lights before leaving will carry these habits into their future careers. Finally, a green campus can set an example for society, encouraging more people to join the effort.","zh":"首先，绿色校园使生活在其中的每个人受益。节约用电、减少浪费和种植更多树木，能为学习和生活创造更清洁、更健康的环境。此外，这些做法塑造我们的日常习惯。学会回收纸张或离开前关灯的学生，会把这些习惯带入未来的职业生活。最后，绿色校园能够为社会树立榜样，鼓励更多人参与这项努力。"},{"en":"Therefore, we should start with small actions: bringing our own water bottles, using both sides of the paper, and refusing unnecessary plastic bags.","zh":"因此，我们应该从小事做起：自带水瓶、使用纸张的两面，以及拒绝不必要的塑料袋。"},{"en":"In short, protecting the environment begins at home — and the campus is our home.","zh":"总之，保护环境始于自己的家园——而校园就是我们的家园。"}],"structure":[{"label":"01 背景责任","summary":"环境问题变严重；绿色校园应被看成口号还是实际责任？","keywords":["environmental problems","green development","practical responsibility"]},{"label":"02 三层意义","summary":"校园环境改善 → 日常习惯形成 → 社会示范扩大。","keywords":["cleaner environment","daily habits","set an example"]},{"label":"03 小事做起","summary":"随身带什么？纸用几面？拒绝什么？用三项并列复述。","keywords":["water bottles","both sides","plastic bags"]},{"label":"04 家园收尾","summary":"把校园想成自己的家，回扣从身边保护环境。","keywords":["protect the environment","begins at home","our home"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet4-06-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet4-06-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-06-01.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659},{"id":"cet4-06-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet4-06-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-06-02.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659},{"id":"cet4-06-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet4-06-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-06-03.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1660},{"id":"cet4-06-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet4-06-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-06-04.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659}],"keywords":["become increasingly serious","has gained wide attention","building a green campus","not merely a slogan but a practical responsibility","benefits everyone living on it","a cleaner and healthier environment","Saving electricity, reducing waste and planting more trees","shape our daily habits","turn off the lights","recycle paper","set an example for society","encouraging more people to join the effort"],"transferTip":"环保话题共用责任与行动结构；写垃圾、出行、资源时，各自更换对象、效果和具体措施。"},{"id":"cet4-07","level":"CET4","number":7,"title":"传承中国传统文化","titleEn":"Preserving Traditional Chinese Culture","genre":"议论文 · 文化传承","sentences":[{"en":"China has a civilization of more than five thousand years, and its traditional culture is a treasure that belongs not only to the Chinese people but to the whole world.","zh":"中国拥有五千多年的文明，其传统文化是一份不仅属于中国人民、也属于全世界的珍宝。","section":"立论","targets":["a civilization of more than five thousand years"]},{"en":"In recent years, more and more college students have realized how important it is to understand and preserve this heritage.","zh":"近年来，越来越多的大学生已经意识到理解和保护这份文化遗产是多么重要。","section":"立论","targets":["understand and preserve this heritage","how important it is to"]},{"en":"To begin with, traditional culture strengthens our cultural confidence.","zh":"首先，传统文化增强我们的文化自信。","section":"意义一","targets":["strengthens our cultural confidence"]},{"en":"A person who understands where they come from is more likely to stand firm in a globalized world.","zh":"一个了解自身文化根源的人，更有可能在全球化的世界中站稳脚跟。","section":"意义一","targets":["stand firm","understands where they come from"]},{"en":"In addition, it serves as a bridge for communication.","zh":"此外，传统文化充当沟通的桥梁。","section":"意义二","targets":["serves as a bridge for communication"]},{"en":"Thanks to cultural exchanges, foreigners can appreciate Chinese calligraphy, tea ceremonies and traditional festivals, which deepens friendship between nations.","zh":"借助文化交流，外国人能够欣赏中国书法、茶道和传统节日，从而加深国家间的友谊。","section":"意义二","targets":["Chinese calligraphy, tea ceremonies and traditional festivals","deepens friendship between nations"]},{"en":"How, then, can we carry this heritage forward?","zh":"那么，我们怎样才能传承这份文化遗产呢？","section":"做法","targets":["How, then, can we","carry this heritage forward"]},{"en":"We may start by reading classics, visiting museums and taking part in traditional festivals.","zh":"我们可以从阅读经典、参观博物馆和参加传统节日活动做起。","section":"做法","targets":["start by","reading classics, visiting museums and taking part in traditional festivals"]},{"en":"In short, tradition and modernity can enrich each other, and it is our duty to pass this treasure on to the next generation.","zh":"总之，传统与现代可以相互丰富，而把这份珍宝传给下一代是我们的责任。","section":"总结","targets":["enrich each other","pass this treasure on to the next generation"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"China has a civilization of more than five thousand years, and its traditional culture is a treasure that belongs not only to the Chinese people but to the whole world. In recent years, more and more college students have realized how important it is to understand and preserve this heritage.","zh":"中国拥有五千多年的文明，其传统文化是一份不仅属于中国人民、也属于全世界的珍宝。近年来，越来越多的大学生已经意识到理解和保护这份文化遗产是多么重要。"},{"en":"To begin with, traditional culture strengthens our cultural confidence. A person who understands where they come from is more likely to stand firm in a globalized world. In addition, it serves as a bridge for communication. Thanks to cultural exchanges, foreigners can appreciate Chinese calligraphy, tea ceremonies and traditional festivals, which deepens friendship between nations.","zh":"首先，传统文化增强我们的文化自信。一个了解自身文化根源的人，更有可能在全球化的世界中站稳脚跟。此外，传统文化充当沟通的桥梁。借助文化交流，外国人能够欣赏中国书法、茶道和传统节日，从而加深国家间的友谊。"},{"en":"How, then, can we carry this heritage forward? We may start by reading classics, visiting museums and taking part in traditional festivals.","zh":"那么，我们怎样才能传承这份文化遗产呢？我们可以从阅读经典、参观博物馆和参加传统节日活动做起。"},{"en":"In short, tradition and modernity can enrich each other, and it is our duty to pass this treasure on to the next generation.","zh":"总之，传统与现代可以相互丰富，而把这份珍宝传给下一代是我们的责任。"}],"structure":[{"label":"01 珍宝价值","summary":"文化属于谁？大学生应理解并保护什么？","keywords":["a cultural treasure","understand and preserve","this heritage"]},{"label":"02 双重意义","summary":"向内增强文化自信；向外搭沟通桥梁，用书法、茶道、节日举例。","keywords":["cultural confidence","a bridge","cultural exchanges"]},{"label":"03 三种行动","summary":"问怎样传承后，按读书 → 参观 → 参与检索。","keywords":["reading classics","visiting museums","traditional festivals"]},{"label":"04 传给下一代","summary":"传统与现代能怎样相处？这份珍宝要交给谁？","keywords":["tradition and modernity","enrich each other","next generation"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet4-07-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet4-07-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-07-01.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659},{"id":"cet4-07-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet4-07-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-07-02.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659},{"id":"cet4-07-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet4-07-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-07-03.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659},{"id":"cet4-07-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet4-07-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-07-04.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1659}],"keywords":["a civilization of more than five thousand years","understand and preserve this heritage","how important it is to","strengthens our cultural confidence","stand firm","understands where they come from","serves as a bridge for communication","Chinese calligraphy, tea ceremonies and traditional festivals","deepens friendship between nations","How, then, can we","carry this heritage forward","start by"],"transferTip":"文化自信、节日、非遗、跨文化沟通各有不同任务；保留语言框架，重新选择对象、理由与行动。"},{"id":"cet4-08","level":"CET4","number":8,"title":"建议信：改善图书馆服务","titleEn":"Letter of Suggestion","genre":"应用文 · 建议信","sentences":[{"en":"Dear Librarian,","zh":"尊敬的图书馆管理员：","section":"称呼","targets":["Dear Librarian,"]},{"en":"I am writing to express my views on how to improve the service of our university library.","zh":"我写信是想就如何改善我们大学图书馆的服务表达我的看法。","section":"身份与目的","targets":["I am writing to express my views on","improve the service"]},{"en":"As a student who visits the library almost every day, I have noticed a few problems that deserve attention.","zh":"作为一名几乎每天都去图书馆的学生，我注意到一些值得关注的问题。","section":"身份与目的","targets":["deserve attention","who visits the library"]},{"en":"To begin with, many books on popular subjects are seriously out of date.","zh":"首先，许多热门学科的书籍已经严重过时。","section":"建议一：更新馆藏","targets":["To begin with","out of date"]},{"en":"I suggest that the library update its collection, especially in the fields of computer science and economics.","zh":"我建议图书馆更新馆藏，尤其是计算机科学和经济学领域的书籍。","section":"建议一：更新馆藏","targets":["in the fields of","update its collection"]},{"en":"In addition, the reading rooms are often fully occupied during the exam season.","zh":"此外，在考试季，阅览室经常座无虚席。","section":"建议二：增加空间与时间","targets":["In addition","fully occupied"]},{"en":"It would be helpful if more seats were added or the opening hours extended.","zh":"如果能增加座位或延长开放时间，将会很有帮助。","section":"建议二：增加空间与时间","targets":["It would be helpful if","more seats were added"]},{"en":"Furthermore, a short training session on how to use the electronic database would benefit many first-year students.","zh":"另外，开展一次关于如何使用电子数据库的短期培训，将使许多大一学生受益。","section":"建议三：开展使用培训","targets":["a short training session","would benefit"]},{"en":"I would be grateful if you could consider my suggestions.","zh":"如果您能考虑我的建议，我将不胜感激。","section":"致谢与期待","targets":["I would be grateful if you could","consider my suggestions"]},{"en":"Thank you for your time, and I look forward to seeing a better library in the future.","zh":"感谢您抽出时间，我期待未来能看到一个更好的图书馆。","section":"致谢与期待","targets":["Thank you for your time","look forward to seeing"]},{"en":"Yours sincerely,","zh":"此致，","section":"敬语与落款","targets":["Yours sincerely,"]},{"en":"Li Ming","zh":"李明","section":"敬语与落款","targets":["Li Ming"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"Dear Librarian,","zh":"尊敬的图书馆管理员："},{"en":"I am writing to express my views on how to improve the service of our university library. As a student who visits the library almost every day, I have noticed a few problems that deserve attention.","zh":"我写信是想就如何改善我们大学图书馆的服务表达我的看法。作为一名几乎每天都去图书馆的学生，我注意到一些值得关注的问题。"},{"en":"To begin with, many books on popular subjects are seriously out of date. I suggest that the library update its collection, especially in the fields of computer science and economics. In addition, the reading rooms are often fully occupied during the exam season. It would be helpful if more seats were added or the opening hours extended. Furthermore, a short training session on how to use the electronic database would benefit many first-year students.","zh":"首先，许多热门学科的书籍已经严重过时。我建议图书馆更新馆藏，尤其是计算机科学和经济学领域的书籍。此外，在考试季，阅览室经常座无虚席。如果能增加座位或延长开放时间，将会很有帮助。另外，开展一次关于如何使用电子数据库的短期培训，将使许多大一学生受益。"},{"en":"I would be grateful if you could consider my suggestions. Thank you for your time, and I look forward to seeing a better library in the future.","zh":"如果您能考虑我的建议，我将不胜感激。感谢您抽出时间，我期待未来能看到一个更好的图书馆。"},{"en":"Yours sincerely,\nLi Ming","zh":"此致，李明"}],"structure":[{"label":"先开信：称呼＋来意","summary":"管理员→来提意见→每日读者→发现问题；现状用现在时。","keywords":["Dear Librarian","express my views","deserve attention"]},{"label":"前两条：问题→办法","summary":"书旧→更新；座满→加座/延时；suggest that＋主语＋原形，would＋if委婉建议。","keywords":["out of date","update its collection","more seats"]},{"label":"第三条：对象＋收益","summary":"再加培训→电子数据库→帮助大一学生；would benefit说明预期收益。","keywords":["training session","electronic database","first-year students"]},{"label":"再收信：请求→致谢→落款","summary":"请考虑→谢时间→盼改善→敬语→署名；look forward to＋动名词。","keywords":["consider my suggestions","look forward to","Yours sincerely"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet4-08-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet4-08-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-08-01.thumb.webp","width":1024,"height":1536},{"id":"cet4-08-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet4-08-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-08-02.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1619},{"id":"cet4-08-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet4-08-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-08-03.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1619},{"id":"cet4-08-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet4-08-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-08-04.thumb.webp","width":1024,"height":1536}],"keywords":["Dear Librarian,","I am writing to express my views on","improve the service","deserve attention","who visits the library","To begin with","out of date","in the fields of","update its collection","In addition","fully occupied","It would be helpful if"],"transferTip":"迁移时先换收信人和写信目的，再为每个问题配一项建议；称呼、姓名及任何时地信息以题干为准，避免只替换library却留下旧问题。"},{"id":"cet4-09","level":"CET4","number":9,"title":"通知：英语演讲比赛","titleEn":"Notice","genre":"应用文 · 通知","sentences":[{"en":"NOTICE","zh":"通知","section":"标题","targets":[]},{"en":"October 15, 2026","zh":"2026年10月15日","section":"发布日期","targets":["October 15, 2026"]},{"en":"In order to improve students' English speaking ability and enrich campus life, the Student Union is going to hold an English Speech Contest.","zh":"为了提高学生的英语口语能力并丰富校园生活，学生会将举办一场英语演讲比赛。","section":"事由与主办方","targets":["In order to","enrich campus life"]},{"en":"The contest will take place in Lecture Hall 201 on October 30, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m.","zh":"比赛将于10月30日下午2点至5点在201报告厅举行。","section":"具体安排：时地与规则","targets":["will take place","in Lecture Hall 201"]},{"en":"The theme of this year's contest is \"Youth and Responsibility.\"","zh":"今年比赛的主题是“青春与责任”。","section":"具体安排：时地与规则","targets":["The theme of this year's contest is","Youth and Responsibility"]},{"en":"Each contestant will have five minutes to deliver a speech, after which the judges will ask one question.","zh":"每位参赛者将有五分钟发表演讲，之后评委会提出一个问题。","section":"具体安排：时地与规则","targets":["deliver a speech","will ask one question"]},{"en":"Those who are interested are warmly welcome to sign up at the Student Union office before October 25.","zh":"欢迎感兴趣的同学在10月25日之前到学生会办公室报名。","section":"报名方式与奖励","targets":["sign up","before October 25"]},{"en":"Prizes will be awarded to the top three winners.","zh":"前三名获胜者将获得奖品。","section":"报名方式与奖励","targets":["the top three winners","will be awarded to"]},{"en":"For further information, please contact Li Ming at 138-0000-0000.","zh":"如需更多信息，请拨打138-0000-0000联系李明。","section":"联系方式","targets":["For further information, please contact"]},{"en":"The Student Union","zh":"学生会","section":"发布单位","targets":["The Student Union"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"NOTICE","zh":"通知"},{"en":"October 15, 2026","zh":"2026年10月15日"},{"en":"In order to improve students' English speaking ability and enrich campus life, the Student Union is going to hold an English Speech Contest.","zh":"为了提高学生的英语口语能力并丰富校园生活，学生会将举办一场英语演讲比赛。"},{"en":"The contest will take place in Lecture Hall 201 on October 30, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. The theme of this year's contest is \"Youth and Responsibility.\" Each contestant will have five minutes to deliver a speech, after which the judges will ask one question.","zh":"比赛将于10月30日下午2点至5点在201报告厅举行。今年比赛的主题是“青春与责任”。每位参赛者将有五分钟发表演讲，之后评委会提出一个问题。"},{"en":"Those who are interested are warmly welcome to sign up at the Student Union office before October 25. Prizes will be awarded to the top three winners.","zh":"欢迎感兴趣的同学在10月25日之前到学生会办公室报名。前三名获胜者将获得奖品。"},{"en":"For further information, please contact Li Ming at 138-0000-0000.","zh":"如需更多信息，请拨打138-0000-0000联系李明。"},{"en":"The Student Union","zh":"学生会"}],"structure":[{"label":"先辨通知：标题＋日期＋事由","summary":"NOTICE→发布日期→提高口语/丰富生活→学生会办比赛；计划用is going to。","keywords":["NOTICE","October 15, 2026","hold a contest"]},{"label":"再排活动：地点＋时间＋规则","summary":"201厅→30日下午→青春责任→五分钟演讲再问一题；安排用will，主题用is。","keywords":["will take place","Youth and Responsibility","after which"]},{"label":"然后报名：截止＋奖励","summary":"感兴趣→25日前→学生会报名→前三名获奖；把活动日与报名截止日分清。","keywords":["sign up","before October 25","will be awarded"]},{"label":"最后发布：咨询＋单位","summary":"进一步信息→联系人/号码→学生会落款；电话、日期和单位按题干换。","keywords":["further information","please contact","The Student Union"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet4-09-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet4-09-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-09-01.thumb.webp","width":972,"height":1619},{"id":"cet4-09-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet4-09-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-09-02.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1620},{"id":"cet4-09-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet4-09-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-09-03.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1620},{"id":"cet4-09-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet4-09-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-09-04.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1619}],"keywords":["October 15, 2026","In order to","enrich campus life","will take place","in Lecture Hall 201","The theme of this year's contest is","Youth and Responsibility","deliver a speech","will ask one question","sign up","before October 25","the top three winners"],"transferTip":"先列题干要素再写通知：活动、主办方、时地、内容、参与方式、联系。只保留适用的信息；标题、日期与落款要求按题干，练习日期和电话不照抄。"},{"id":"cet4-10","level":"CET4","number":10,"title":"校园报道：志愿清洁活动","titleEn":"Campus News Report","genre":"应用文 · 新闻报道","sentences":[{"en":"A Successful Volunteer Activity Held on Campus","zh":"校园成功举办志愿活动","section":"标题与记者署名","targets":["A Successful Volunteer Activity Held on Campus"]},{"en":"By Li Ming","zh":"记者：李明","section":"标题与记者署名","targets":["By Li Ming"]},{"en":"Last Saturday, a volunteer activity named \"Clean Our Campus\" was held by the Student Union, attracting more than two hundred students.","zh":"上周六，学生会举办了一项名为“清洁我们的校园”的志愿活动，吸引了两百多名学生参加。","section":"导语：时间、人物、事件","targets":["Last Saturday","attracting more than two hundred students"]},{"en":"The activity started at nine in the morning.","zh":"活动于上午九点开始。","section":"过程起点：开始时间","targets":["at nine in the morning","started at nine"]},{"en":"Volunteers were divided into ten groups and cleaned different areas, including the teaching buildings, the library and the sports ground.","zh":"志愿者被分为十组，清洁不同区域，包括教学楼、图书馆和运动场。","section":"过程细节：分工、行动、时长","targets":["were divided into ten groups","cleaned different areas"]},{"en":"Besides picking up rubbish, some students put up posters to remind others of the importance of keeping the campus clean.","zh":"除了捡拾垃圾，一些学生还张贴海报，提醒他人保持校园清洁的重要性。","section":"过程细节：分工、行动、时长","targets":["put up posters","remind others of"]},{"en":"The whole activity lasted about three hours.","zh":"整个活动持续了大约三个小时。","section":"过程细节：分工、行动、时长","targets":["lasted about three hours"]},{"en":"\"The campus is our second home, and it feels great to make it cleaner,\" said Wang Hua, a sophomore from the School of Computer Science.","zh":"“校园是我们的第二个家，把它变得更干净让人感觉很棒。”计算机学院大二学生王华说。","section":"引语：参与者感受","targets":["our second home","a sophomore"]},{"en":"According to the organizer, similar activities will be held every month.","zh":"据组织者介绍，今后每个月都会举办类似活动。","section":"后续：主办方计划与期待","targets":["According to the organizer","will be held every month"]},{"en":"The Student Union hopes that more students will join in and contribute to a greener campus.","zh":"学生会希望更多学生参与进来，为建设更绿色的校园贡献力量。","section":"后续：主办方计划与期待","targets":["contribute to","will join in"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"A Successful Volunteer Activity Held on Campus\nBy Li Ming","zh":"校园成功举办志愿活动记者：李明"},{"en":"Last Saturday, a volunteer activity named \"Clean Our Campus\" was held by the Student Union, attracting more than two hundred students.","zh":"上周六，学生会举办了一项名为“清洁我们的校园”的志愿活动，吸引了两百多名学生参加。"},{"en":"The activity started at nine in the morning. Volunteers were divided into ten groups and cleaned different areas, including the teaching buildings, the library and the sports ground. Besides picking up rubbish, some students put up posters to remind others of the importance of keeping the campus clean. The whole activity lasted about three hours.","zh":"活动于上午九点开始。志愿者被分为十组，清洁不同区域，包括教学楼、图书馆和运动场。除了捡拾垃圾，一些学生还张贴海报，提醒他人保持校园清洁的重要性。整个活动持续了大约三个小时。"},{"en":"\"The campus is our second home, and it feels great to make it cleaner,\" said Wang Hua, a sophomore from the School of Computer Science.","zh":"“校园是我们的第二个家，把它变得更干净让人感觉很棒。”计算机学院大二学生王华说。"},{"en":"According to the organizer, similar activities will be held every month. The Student Union hopes that more students will join in and contribute to a greener campus.","zh":"据组织者介绍，今后每个月都会举办类似活动。学生会希望更多学生参与进来，为建设更绿色的校园贡献力量。"}],"structure":[{"label":"先亮新闻：标题＋署名＋导语","summary":"活动标题→By署名→上周六→学生会办清洁→两百多人；was held交代过去事实。","keywords":["By Li Ming","was held by","attracting students"]},{"label":"再讲过程：起点＋分工＋行动","summary":"九点开始→十组分区→捡垃圾/贴海报→持续三小时；started/divided/cleaned/lasted。","keywords":["were divided into","put up posters","lasted three hours"]},{"label":"加入声音：原话＋姓名＋身份","summary":"第二个家→清洁很快乐→王华说→计算机学院大二生；said过去时，引语可现在时。","keywords":["our second home","said Wang Hua","a sophomore"]},{"label":"最后展望：来源＋计划＋期待","summary":"据组织者→以后每月办→学生会盼参与；后续will be held，当前态度hopes。","keywords":["According to","every month","contribute to"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet4-10-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet4-10-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-10-01.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1620},{"id":"cet4-10-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet4-10-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-10-02.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1620},{"id":"cet4-10-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet4-10-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-10-03.thumb.webp","width":948,"height":1660},{"id":"cet4-10-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet4-10-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet4-10-04.thumb.webp","width":971,"height":1619}],"keywords":["A Successful Volunteer Activity Held on Campus","By Li Ming","Last Saturday","attracting more than two hundred students","at nine in the morning","started at nine","were divided into ten groups","cleaned different areas","put up posters","remind others of","lasted about three hours","our second home"],"transferTip":"报道迁移先列时间、地点、人物、事件及目的，再按题干选过程细节和评价；日期、人数、引语内容与署名均按题意，已发生事实用过去时，后续安排可用将来时。"},{"id":"cet6-01","level":"CET6","number":1,"title":"自律与坚持","titleEn":"Self Discipline and Perseverance","genre":"议论文","sentences":[{"en":"Self-discipline plays an important role in helping college students achieve their goals.","zh":"自律在帮助大学生实现目标方面发挥着重要作用。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["plays an important role in"]},{"en":"University life gives us more freedom, but it also requires us to manage our own time.","zh":"大学生活给予我们更多自由，但也要求我们管理自己的时间。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["manage our own time"]},{"en":"Without clear plans and consistent effort, we may spend hours on entertainment while leaving important tasks unfinished.","zh":"如果缺少明确的计划和持续的努力，我们可能花数小时娱乐，却留下重要任务没有完成。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["clear plans and consistent effort"]},{"en":"First, self-discipline helps us turn plans into action.","zh":"首先，自律帮助我们把计划变成行动。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["turn plans into action"]},{"en":"For example, a student preparing for an English exam can set aside thirty minutes each day to review vocabulary.","zh":"例如，一名准备英语考试的学生可以每天留出三十分钟复习词汇。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["set aside thirty minutes"]},{"en":"This habit makes progress more manageable than studying only before the exam.","zh":"与只在考前学习相比，这种习惯让学习进步更容易管理。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"Second, perseverance helps us deal with difficulties.","zh":"其次，坚持帮助我们应对困难。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["deal with difficulties"]},{"en":"When we make mistakes or fail to improve immediately, we need to adjust our methods and continue practicing.","zh":"当我们犯错或没有立即取得进步时，需要调整方法并继续练习。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["adjust our methods"]},{"en":"By completing small tasks regularly, we can also build confidence in our ability to reach larger goals.","zh":"通过定期完成小任务，我们也能增强对自己实现更大目标的能力的信心。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["build confidence"]},{"en":"To develop these qualities, we should set realistic goals and begin with simple daily actions.","zh":"要培养这些品质，我们应该设定切实可行的目标，从简单的日常行动开始。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["set realistic goals"]},{"en":"Keeping a record of our progress can help us identify problems and make timely changes.","zh":"记录我们的进度可以帮助我们发现问题并及时作出调整。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["Keeping a record of our progress"]},{"en":"With patience and regular practice, we can use our time more effectively and gradually move closer to our goals.","zh":"凭借耐心和规律练习，我们能够更有效地利用时间，逐渐接近自己的目标。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["move closer to our goals"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"Self-discipline plays an important role in helping college students achieve their goals. University life gives us more freedom, but it also requires us to manage our own time. Without clear plans and consistent effort, we may spend hours on entertainment while leaving important tasks unfinished.","zh":"自律在帮助大学生实现目标方面发挥着重要作用。大学生活给予我们更多自由，也要求我们管理自己的时间。缺少明确计划和持续努力，我们可能花数小时娱乐，却留下重要任务没有完成。"},{"en":"First, self-discipline helps us turn plans into action. For example, a student preparing for an English exam can set aside thirty minutes each day to review vocabulary. This habit makes progress more manageable than studying only before the exam. Second, perseverance helps us deal with difficulties. When we make mistakes or fail to improve immediately, we need to adjust our methods and continue practicing. By completing small tasks regularly, we can also build confidence in our ability to reach larger goals.","zh":"首先，自律帮助我们把计划变成行动。例如，准备英语考试的学生可以每天留出三十分钟复习词汇。这种习惯让进步更容易管理，比只在考前学习更稳妥。其次，坚持帮助我们应对困难。当我们犯错或没有马上进步时，需要调整方法并继续练习。定期完成小任务，也能增强我们实现更大目标的信心。"},{"en":"To develop these qualities, we should set realistic goals and begin with simple daily actions. Keeping a record of our progress can help us identify problems and make timely changes. With patience and regular practice, we can use our time more effectively and gradually move closer to our goals.","zh":"要培养这些品质，我们应设定切实可行的目标，从简单的日常行动开始。记录进度有助于发现问题并及时调整。凭借耐心和规律练习，我们能够更有效地利用时间，逐渐接近自己的目标。"}],"structure":[{"label":"自由需要管理","summary":"自由需要管理","keywords":["manage our own time"]},{"label":"每日小任务让计划落地","summary":"每日小任务让计划落地","keywords":["turn plans into action","set aside thirty minutes"]},{"label":"困难时调整并坚持","summary":"困难时调整并坚持","keywords":["deal with difficulties","build confidence"]},{"label":"目标与进度记录","summary":"目标与进度记录","keywords":["set realistic goals","Keeping a record of our progress"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet6-01-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet6-01-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-01-01.thumb.webp","width":1024,"height":1536},{"id":"cet6-01-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet6-01-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-01-02.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-01-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet6-01-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-01-03.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-01-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet6-01-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-01-04.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672}],"keywords":["turn plans into action","set aside thirty minutes","set realistic goals","Keeping a record of our progress","plays an important role in","manage our own time","clear plans and consistent effort","deal with difficulties","adjust our methods","build confidence","move closer to our goals"],"transferTip":"可用于目标管理和坚持类题目。写拖延时，增加拖延的具体后果；写时间管理时，把主体论证改为任务排序和安排时间，不能只替换标题。"},{"id":"cet6-02","level":"CET6","number":2,"title":"学习方法与自主学习","titleEn":"Learning How to Learn","genre":"议论文","sentences":[{"en":"Learning how to learn is essential for college students.","zh":"学会如何学习对大学生至关重要。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"As knowledge and technology change, the information we acquire in class may not be enough for future challenges.","zh":"随着知识和技术的变化，我们在课堂上获得的信息可能不足以应对未来的挑战。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"We therefore need both a solid foundation of knowledge and the ability to continue learning independently.","zh":"因此，我们既需要扎实的知识基础，也需要持续自主学习的能力。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["a solid foundation of knowledge","continue learning independently"]},{"en":"Effective learning begins with clear goals.","zh":"有效学习始于明确的目标。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["clear goals"]},{"en":"When we know what we need to understand, we can choose suitable materials and avoid wasting time on unrelated information.","zh":"当我们知道自己需要理解什么时，就能选择合适的材料，避免把时间浪费在无关信息上。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["choose suitable materials"]},{"en":"It also requires active practice.","zh":"有效学习也需要主动练习。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["active practice"]},{"en":"For example, after reading a chapter, a student can close the book and explain the main ideas in their own words.","zh":"例如，读完一章后，学生可以合上书，用自己的话解释主要观点。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["in their own words"]},{"en":"This helps reveal gaps in understanding.","zh":"这有助于发现理解上的缺口。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["reveal gaps in understanding"]},{"en":"Reviewing mistakes and applying knowledge to new problems can then make learning more effective.","zh":"随后，回顾错误并将知识应用到新问题中，可以进一步提高学习效果。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["applying knowledge to new problems"]},{"en":"These habits allow us to take greater responsibility for our studies instead of depending entirely on teachers.","zh":"这些习惯让我们对自己的学习承担更多责任，而不是完全依赖老师。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["take greater responsibility for our studies"]},{"en":"To become better learners, we should make practical study plans and regularly reflect on our progress.","zh":"要成为更好的学习者，我们应该制定可行的学习计划，定期反思自己的进度。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["regularly reflect on our progress"]},{"en":"When a method does not work, we should adjust it and ask for guidance if necessary.","zh":"当一种方法无效时，我们应该调整方法，并在必要时寻求指导。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["ask for guidance"]},{"en":"By developing these habits, we can learn new skills with greater confidence and prepare ourselves for future changes.","zh":"养成这些习惯后，我们就能更有信心地学习新技能，为未来的变化做好准备。","section":"建议与总结","targets":[]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"Learning how to learn is essential for college students. As knowledge and technology change, the information we acquire in class may not be enough for future challenges. We therefore need both a solid foundation of knowledge and the ability to continue learning independently.","zh":"学会如何学习对大学生至关重要。随着知识和技术变化，课堂上获得的信息可能不足以应对未来挑战。因此，我们既需要扎实的知识基础，也需要持续自主学习的能力。"},{"en":"Effective learning begins with clear goals. When we know what we need to understand, we can choose suitable materials and avoid wasting time on unrelated information. It also requires active practice. For example, after reading a chapter, a student can close the book and explain the main ideas in their own words. This helps reveal gaps in understanding. Reviewing mistakes and applying knowledge to new problems can then make learning more effective. These habits allow us to take greater responsibility for our studies instead of depending entirely on teachers.","zh":"有效学习始于明确目标。知道需要理解什么，才能选择合适材料，避免在无关信息上浪费时间。有效学习也需要主动练习。例如，读完一章后，学生可以合上书，用自己的话解释主要观点，这有助于发现理解上的缺口。回顾错误并将知识应用到新问题中，也能提高学习效果。这些习惯让我们对学习承担更多责任，而不是完全依赖老师。"},{"en":"To become better learners, we should make practical study plans and regularly reflect on our progress. When a method does not work, we should adjust it and ask for guidance if necessary. By developing these habits, we can learn new skills with greater confidence and prepare ourselves for future changes.","zh":"要成为更好的学习者，我们应制定可行计划，定期反思进度。方法无效时，应调整方法，必要时寻求指导。养成这些习惯，能让我们更有信心地学习新技能，为未来变化做好准备。"}],"structure":[{"label":"变化要求持续学习","summary":"变化要求持续学习","keywords":["a solid foundation of knowledge","continue learning independently"]},{"label":"明确目标","summary":"明确目标","keywords":["clear goals","choose suitable materials"]},{"label":"主动回忆和应用","summary":"主动回忆和应用","keywords":["in their own words","reveal gaps in understanding"]},{"label":"反思调整","summary":"反思调整","keywords":["regularly reflect on our progress","ask for guidance"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet6-02-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet6-02-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-02-01.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-02-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet6-02-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-02-02.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-02-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet6-02-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-02-03.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-02-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet6-02-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-02-04.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672}],"keywords":["a solid foundation of knowledge","in their own words","reveal gaps in understanding","take greater responsibility for our studies","continue learning independently","clear goals","choose suitable materials","active practice","applying knowledge to new problems","regularly reflect on our progress","ask for guidance"],"transferTip":"可用于自主学习和学习方法。写基础知识的重要性时，应把基础知识放在中心，论证它如何帮助理解复杂内容，不能继续主要写自主学习。"},{"id":"cet6-03","level":"CET6","number":3,"title":"数字时代的批判性思维","titleEn":"Critical Thinking in the Digital Age","genre":"议论文","sentences":[{"en":"Critical thinking is an important skill in the digital age.","zh":"批判性思维是数字时代的一项重要技能。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"Every day, we encounter news, advertisements and opinions on the Internet.","zh":"每天，我们都会在互联网上接触新闻、广告和各种观点。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"Although this information can be useful, some of it may be inaccurate or misleading.","zh":"虽然这些信息可能有用，其中一些却可能不准确或具有误导性。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["inaccurate or misleading"]},{"en":"We need to evaluate what we read before accepting or sharing it.","zh":"在接受或分享所读内容之前，我们需要先对它进行评估。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["evaluate what we read"]},{"en":"First, careful judgment helps us avoid poor decisions.","zh":"首先，谨慎判断有助于我们避免作出错误决策。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["avoid poor decisions"]},{"en":"For example, an attractive advertisement may promise that a product can solve a problem immediately.","zh":"例如，一则吸引人的广告可能承诺某种产品能立即解决一个问题。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"Checking reliable sources before buying it can prevent unnecessary spending.","zh":"购买该产品之前核实可靠的信息来源，可以避免不必要的支出。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["Checking reliable sources"]},{"en":"Second, critical thinking allows us to understand different viewpoints.","zh":"其次，批判性思维让我们能够理解不同的观点。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["understand different viewpoints"]},{"en":"Instead of accepting a claim because it is popular, we should examine its evidence and consider other explanations.","zh":"我们应该考察一种说法的证据并考虑其他解释，而不是因为它很流行就接受它。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["examine its evidence","consider other explanations"]},{"en":"A message with many likes is not necessarily true, and disagreement does not automatically mean that someone is wrong.","zh":"一条获得许多点赞的信息不一定真实，意见不同也不自动意味着某个人就是错的。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"These habits help us form opinions based on reasons rather than emotions.","zh":"这些习惯帮助我们依据理由而非情绪形成观点。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["based on reasons rather than emotions"]},{"en":"We can develop this ability by asking who produced the information, what evidence supports it and whether other trustworthy sources agree.","zh":"我们可以通过这些提问培养这种能力：谁发布了信息，什么证据支持它，其他可信来源是否持相同看法。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["trustworthy sources"]},{"en":"Reading widely and discussing ideas respectfully are also useful.","zh":"广泛阅读并尊重地讨论观点，也很有帮助。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["Reading widely"]},{"en":"By practicing these habits, we can make better use of online information and become more responsible Internet users.","zh":"通过练习这些习惯，我们能够更好地利用网络信息，成为更负责任的互联网使用者。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["responsible Internet users"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"Critical thinking is an important skill in the digital age. Every day, we encounter news, advertisements and opinions on the Internet. Although this information can be useful, some of it may be inaccurate or misleading. We need to evaluate what we read before accepting or sharing it.","zh":"批判性思维是数字时代的重要技能。每天，我们都会在网上遇到新闻、广告和各种观点。这些信息虽有价值，其中一些却可能不准确或有误导性。在接受或分享之前，我们需要评估所读内容。"},{"en":"First, careful judgment helps us avoid poor decisions. For example, an attractive advertisement may promise that a product can solve a problem immediately. Checking reliable sources before buying it can prevent unnecessary spending. Second, critical thinking allows us to understand different viewpoints. Instead of accepting a claim because it is popular, we should examine its evidence and consider other explanations. A message with many likes is not necessarily true, and disagreement does not automatically mean that someone is wrong. These habits help us form opinions based on reasons rather than emotions.","zh":"首先，谨慎判断帮助我们避免错误决策。例如，吸引人的广告可能承诺某产品能马上解决问题，购买前核实可靠来源可以避免不必要的支出。其次，批判性思维帮助我们理解不同观点。我们应考察证据并考虑其他解释，而不是因为一种说法流行就接受它。点赞多的信息不一定真实，意见不同也不代表某个人必然错误。这些习惯帮助我们依据理由而非情绪形成观点。"},{"en":"We can develop this ability by asking who produced the information, what evidence supports it and whether other trustworthy sources agree. Reading widely and discussing ideas respectfully are also useful. By practicing these habits, we can make better use of online information and become more responsible Internet users.","zh":"我们可以通过提问培养这种能力：谁发布了信息，什么证据支持它，其他可信来源是否同意？广泛阅读、尊重地讨论也有帮助。练习这些习惯，能让我们更好地利用网络信息，成为更负责任的网民。"}],"structure":[{"label":"信息可能不可靠","summary":"信息可能不可靠","keywords":["inaccurate or misleading"]},{"label":"核实避免错误决策","summary":"核实避免错误决策","keywords":["avoid poor decisions","Checking reliable sources"]},{"label":"考察不同观点","summary":"考察不同观点","keywords":["examine its evidence","consider other explanations"]},{"label":"来源与证据交叉核实","summary":"来源与证据交叉核实","keywords":["trustworthy sources","Reading widely"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet6-03-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet6-03-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-03-01.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-03-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet6-03-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-03-02.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-03-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet6-03-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-03-03.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-03-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet6-03-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-03-04.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672}],"keywords":["inaccurate or misleading","examine its evidence","consider other explanations","trustworthy sources","evaluate what we read","avoid poor decisions","Checking reliable sources","understand different viewpoints","based on reasons rather than emotions","Reading widely","responsible Internet users"],"transferTip":"可用于网络虚假信息和理性判断。写数字素养时，还需补充工具使用和隐私保护；写数字鸿沟时，要重新论证设备与技能差异。"},{"id":"cet6-04","level":"CET6","number":4,"title":"人工智能与人类创造力","titleEn":"AI and Human Creativity","genre":"议论文","sentences":[{"en":"The growing use of artificial intelligence has raised concerns about human creativity.","zh":"人工智能使用的日益普及引发了人们对人类创造力的担忧。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"AI can help us produce ideas and complete tasks quickly, but relying on it too heavily may reduce opportunities for independent thinking.","zh":"人工智能可以帮助我们产生想法并快速完成任务，但过度依赖它可能减少独立思考的机会。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["opportunities for independent thinking","relying on it too heavily"]},{"en":"The way we use these tools therefore deserves careful attention.","zh":"因此，我们使用这些工具的方式值得认真关注。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"One concern is that people may accept ready-made answers without developing their own ideas.","zh":"一个令人担忧的问题是，人们可能接受现成答案，而不发展自己的想法。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["ready-made answers"]},{"en":"For example, students who ask AI to write entire essays may miss the practice of choosing arguments and organizing information.","zh":"例如，让人工智能代写整篇作文的学生，可能失去选择论据和组织信息的练习机会。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["choosing arguments and organizing information"]},{"en":"Another concern is that similar suggestions can lead to similar results.","zh":"另一个令人担忧的问题是，相似的建议可能导致相似的结果。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["similar results"]},{"en":"If everyone follows the same generated outline, their work may lack personal insight.","zh":"如果每个人都采用同一种生成提纲，他们的作品可能缺少个人见解。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["lack personal insight"]},{"en":"However, AI can also support creativity when used thoughtfully.","zh":"不过，经过认真思考地使用人工智能，也能支持创造力。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["when used thoughtfully"]},{"en":"It can suggest alternative approaches or point out weaknesses, allowing us to improve ideas that we have already developed ourselves.","zh":"它可以提出其他方法或指出不足，让我们完善那些已经由自己构思出的想法。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["suggest alternative approaches","point out weaknesses"]},{"en":"To use AI responsibly, we should first think about a task independently and then use the tool for feedback.","zh":"要负责任地使用人工智能，我们应该先独立思考任务，再使用工具获取反馈。","section":"建议与总结","targets":[]},{"en":"We also need to check its answers and make our own decisions.","zh":"我们还需要核实它的答案，并自己作出决定。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["make our own decisions"]},{"en":"By keeping an active role in the process, we can benefit from AI while continuing to develop our creative abilities.","zh":"在这个过程中保持主动，我们就能从人工智能中受益，同时继续发展自己的创造能力。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["keeping an active role"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"The growing use of artificial intelligence has raised concerns about human creativity. AI can help us produce ideas and complete tasks quickly, but relying on it too heavily may reduce opportunities for independent thinking. The way we use these tools therefore deserves careful attention.","zh":"人工智能的广泛使用引发了对人类创造力的担忧。AI可以帮助我们产生想法并快速完成任务，但过度依赖它可能减少独立思考的机会。因此，我们使用这些工具的方式值得认真考虑。"},{"en":"One concern is that people may accept ready-made answers without developing their own ideas. For example, students who ask AI to write entire essays may miss the practice of choosing arguments and organizing information. Another concern is that similar suggestions can lead to similar results. If everyone follows the same generated outline, their work may lack personal insight. However, AI can also support creativity when used thoughtfully. It can suggest alternative approaches or point out weaknesses, allowing us to improve ideas that we have already developed ourselves.","zh":"一个问题是，人们可能接受现成答案，不再发展自己的想法。例如，让AI写整篇作文的学生，可能失去选择论据、组织信息的练习机会。另一个问题是，相似建议可能导致相似结果。如果每个人都采用同一种生成提纲，作品可能缺少个人见解。不过，经过思考地使用AI也能支持创造力。它可以提出其他方法或指出不足，帮助我们完善自己已经形成的想法。"},{"en":"To use AI responsibly, we should first think about a task independently and then use the tool for feedback. We also need to check its answers and make our own decisions. By keeping an active role in the process, we can benefit from AI while continuing to develop our creative abilities.","zh":"要负责任地使用AI，我们应先独立思考任务，再用工具获取反馈。我们也需要核实答案并自己作出决定。在这个过程中保持主动，能让我们受益于AI，同时继续发展创造能力。"}],"structure":[{"label":"过度依赖引发担忧","summary":"过度依赖引发担忧","keywords":["opportunities for independent thinking"]},{"label":"缺少独立构思与作品同质化","summary":"缺少独立构思与作品同质化","keywords":["ready-made answers","lack personal insight"]},{"label":"AI提供反馈","summary":"AI提供反馈","keywords":["suggest alternative approaches","point out weaknesses"]},{"label":"先思考再使用","summary":"先思考再使用","keywords":["make our own decisions","keeping an active role"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet6-04-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet6-04-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-04-01.thumb.webp","width":940,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-04-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet6-04-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-04-02.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-04-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet6-04-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-04-03.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-04-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet6-04-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-04-04.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672}],"keywords":["opportunities for independent thinking","ready-made answers","lack personal insight","suggest alternative approaches","relying on it too heavily","choosing arguments and organizing information","similar results","when used thoughtfully","point out weaknesses","make our own decisions","keeping an active role"],"transferTip":"本篇中心是创造力。写AI与就业时，主体段应改成岗位变化和技能培训；写AI提升学习效率时，应增加反馈与针对性练习，不能原文照搬。"},{"id":"cet6-05","level":"CET6","number":5,"title":"团队合作与沟通","titleEn":"Teamwork and Communication","genre":"议论文","sentences":[{"en":"Teamwork and effective communication are valuable skills for college students.","zh":"团队合作和有效沟通是大学生的重要技能。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"Many tasks in university life require people to work together, from classroom presentations to volunteer activities.","zh":"从课堂展示到志愿活动，大学生活中的许多任务都需要人们共同完成。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["work together"]},{"en":"Learning to cooperate helps us complete these tasks and prepares us for future work with others.","zh":"学会合作有助于我们完成这些任务，也为将来与他人共事做好准备。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["prepares us for future work"]},{"en":"First, teamwork allows members to combine different strengths.","zh":"首先，团队合作使成员能够结合各自不同的优势。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["combine different strengths"]},{"en":"In a group project, one student may be good at collecting information, while another is better at explaining ideas.","zh":"在一个小组项目中，一名学生可能擅长搜集信息，而另一名学生更擅长解释观点。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"A clear division of tasks can improve the quality of the final result.","zh":"明确的任务分工能够提高最终成果的质量。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["A clear division of tasks"]},{"en":"Second, communication helps prevent misunderstandings.","zh":"其次，沟通有助于避免误解。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["prevent misunderstandings"]},{"en":"When members explain their progress and difficulties, the team can identify problems early and offer support.","zh":"当成员说明自己的进度和困难时，团队就能及早发现问题并提供支持。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["offer support"]},{"en":"Disagreements are also easier to resolve when people listen carefully and discuss the reasons behind their opinions.","zh":"当人们认真倾听并讨论各自观点背后的理由时，分歧也更容易得到解决。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["listen carefully"]},{"en":"Through this process, students can learn to respect different views and accept useful feedback.","zh":"通过这个过程，学生可以学会尊重不同意见并接受有用的反馈。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["accept useful feedback"]},{"en":"To build a successful team, members should agree on a common goal and take responsibility for their own tasks.","zh":"要建立一个成功的团队，成员应该就共同目标达成一致，并对各自的任务负责。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["agree on a common goal","take responsibility for their own tasks"]},{"en":"They should also communicate regularly instead of waiting until problems become serious.","zh":"他们还应该定期沟通，而不是等到问题严重后才交流。","section":"建议与总结","targets":[]},{"en":"With mutual respect and reliable cooperation, a group can make better use of each member's abilities.","zh":"凭借相互尊重和可靠的合作，一个团队能够更好地发挥每位成员的能力。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["mutual respect and reliable cooperation"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"Teamwork and effective communication are valuable skills for college students. Many tasks in university life require people to work together, from classroom presentations to volunteer activities. Learning to cooperate helps us complete these tasks and prepares us for future work with others.","zh":"团队合作和有效沟通是大学生的重要技能。从课堂展示到志愿活动，大学里的许多任务都需要共同完成。学会合作有助于完成这些任务，也为未来与他人共事做好准备。"},{"en":"First, teamwork allows members to combine different strengths. In a group project, one student may be good at collecting information, while another is better at explaining ideas. A clear division of tasks can improve the quality of the final result. Second, communication helps prevent misunderstandings. When members explain their progress and difficulties, the team can identify problems early and offer support. Disagreements are also easier to resolve when people listen carefully and discuss the reasons behind their opinions. Through this process, students can learn to respect different views and accept useful feedback.","zh":"首先，合作让成员结合各自优势。在小组项目中，一人可能擅长搜集信息，另一人更擅长解释观点。明确分工可以提高最终成果质量。其次，沟通帮助避免误解。成员说明进度与困难，团队就能及早发现问题并提供支持。认真倾听、讨论观点背后的理由，也能让分歧更容易解决。在这个过程中，学生可以学会尊重不同意见并接受有用的反馈。"},{"en":"To build a successful team, members should agree on a common goal and take responsibility for their own tasks. They should also communicate regularly instead of waiting until problems become serious. With mutual respect and reliable cooperation, a group can make better use of each member's abilities.","zh":"要建立成功的团队，成员应就共同目标达成一致，并对自己的任务负责。他们也应定期沟通，而不是等问题严重后才交流。相互尊重、可靠合作，可以让团队更好地发挥每位成员的能力。"}],"structure":[{"label":"校园任务需要合作","summary":"校园任务需要合作","keywords":["work together"]},{"label":"优势互补","summary":"优势互补","keywords":["combine different strengths","A clear division of tasks"]},{"label":"沟通预防误解并解决分歧","summary":"沟通预防误解并解决分歧","keywords":["prevent misunderstandings","listen carefully"]},{"label":"共同目标与各自责任","summary":"共同目标与各自责任","keywords":["agree on a common goal","mutual respect and reliable cooperation"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet6-05-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet6-05-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-05-01.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-05-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet6-05-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-05-02.thumb.webp","width":940,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-05-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet6-05-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-05-03.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-05-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet6-05-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-05-04.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672}],"keywords":["combine different strengths","A clear division of tasks","prevent misunderstandings","agree on a common goal","work together","prepares us for future work","offer support","listen carefully","accept useful feedback","take responsibility for their own tasks","mutual respect and reliable cooperation"],"transferTip":"写团队精神时保留分工例子；写沟通技巧时增加倾听、表达和反馈；写领导力时需要改为目标协调、支持成员与处理分歧。"},{"id":"cet6-06","level":"CET6","number":6,"title":"责任感与帮助他人","titleEn":"Responsibility and Helping Others","genre":"议论文","sentences":[{"en":"A sense of responsibility is important in both personal life and society.","zh":"责任感在个人生活和社会中都很重要。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"Being responsible means keeping our promises, fulfilling our duties and considering how our actions affect others.","zh":"负责任意味着信守承诺、履行义务，并考虑我们的行为会如何影响他人。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["fulfilling our duties","keeping our promises"]},{"en":"For college students, this quality can be developed through ordinary choices in daily life.","zh":"对于大学生来说，这种品质可以通过日常生活中的普通选择来培养。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["ordinary choices in daily life"]},{"en":"First, responsibility builds trust.","zh":"首先，责任感能够建立信任。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["builds trust"]},{"en":"When we finish a group assignment on time, our teammates know that they can depend on us.","zh":"当我们按时完成小组作业时，队友就会知道他们可以依靠我们。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["depend on us"]},{"en":"This makes cooperation easier and reduces unnecessary pressure on others.","zh":"这使合作更容易，也减少了其他人承受的不必要压力。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"Second, responsibility encourages us to offer help when it is needed.","zh":"其次，责任感鼓励我们在他人有需要时提供帮助。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["offer help"]},{"en":"For example, a student can explain a difficult topic to a classmate or volunteer at a community event.","zh":"例如，学生可以向同学解释一个难懂的知识点，或在社区活动中担任志愿者。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"Such actions can solve practical problems and strengthen connections between people.","zh":"这些行动能够解决实际问题，并加强人与人之间的联系。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["strengthen connections between people","solve practical problems"]},{"en":"At the same time, helping others may give us a clearer understanding of their needs and remind us that our abilities can benefit more people than ourselves.","zh":"同时，帮助他人可能让我们更清楚地理解他们的需求，并提醒我们：自己的能力可以让更多人受益，而不只惠及自己。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"We should begin by doing our own work carefully and keeping realistic promises.","zh":"我们应该从认真做好自己的工作、作出切实可行的承诺开始。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["keeping realistic promises"]},{"en":"We can then contribute according to our time and abilities, rather than taking on tasks we cannot complete.","zh":"随后，我们可以根据自己的时间和能力作出贡献，而不是承担自己无法完成的任务。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["according to our time and abilities"]},{"en":"Through consistent and reliable actions, we can become people whom others can trust.","zh":"通过持续可靠的行动，我们能够成为值得他人信赖的人。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["consistent and reliable actions"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"A sense of responsibility is important in both personal life and society. Being responsible means keeping our promises, fulfilling our duties and considering how our actions affect others. For college students, this quality can be developed through ordinary choices in daily life.","zh":"责任感对个人生活和社会都很重要。负责任意味着信守承诺、履行义务，并考虑自己的行为如何影响他人。大学生可以通过日常生活中的普通选择培养这种品质。"},{"en":"First, responsibility builds trust. When we finish a group assignment on time, our teammates know that they can depend on us. This makes cooperation easier and reduces unnecessary pressure on others. Second, responsibility encourages us to offer help when it is needed. For example, a student can explain a difficult topic to a classmate or volunteer at a community event. Such actions can solve practical problems and strengthen connections between people. At the same time, helping others may give us a clearer understanding of their needs and remind us that our abilities can benefit more people than ourselves.","zh":"首先，责任感建立信任。按时完成小组作业，队友就知道可以依靠我们，这让合作更容易，也减少他人不必要的压力。其次，责任感促使我们在需要时提供帮助。例如，学生可以给同学解释难懂的知识点，或在社区活动中做志愿者。这些行动能解决实际问题，加强人与人之间的联系。同时，帮助他人也可能让我们更清楚地理解他们的需求，提醒我们自己的能力可以让更多人受益。"},{"en":"We should begin by doing our own work carefully and keeping realistic promises. We can then contribute according to our time and abilities, rather than taking on tasks we cannot complete. Through consistent and reliable actions, we can become people whom others can trust.","zh":"我们应从认真做好本职工作、作出切实可行的承诺开始，再根据时间与能力作出贡献，而不是承担无法完成的任务。通过持续可靠的行动，我们能够成为值得他人信赖的人。"}],"structure":[{"label":"责任的含义","summary":"责任的含义","keywords":["keeping our promises","fulfilling our duties"]},{"label":"完成任务建立信任","summary":"完成任务建立信任","keywords":["builds trust","depend on us"]},{"label":"帮助他人解决问题","summary":"帮助他人解决问题","keywords":["offer help","strengthen connections between people"]},{"label":"量力而行并守承诺","summary":"量力而行并守承诺","keywords":["according to our time and abilities","consistent and reliable actions"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet6-06-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet6-06-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-06-01.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-06-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet6-06-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-06-02.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-06-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet6-06-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-06-03.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-06-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet6-06-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-06-04.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672}],"keywords":["fulfilling our duties","depend on us","strengthen connections between people","according to our time and abilities","keeping our promises","ordinary choices in daily life","builds trust","offer help","solve practical problems","keeping realistic promises","consistent and reliable actions"],"transferTip":"写家庭责任时，把例子换成分担家务和关心家人；写集体责任时，突出履行分工；写助人为乐时，增加帮助他人的具体价值。"},{"id":"cet6-07","level":"CET6","number":7,"title":"理解与传承中华传统文化","titleEn":"Understanding Traditional Chinese Culture","genre":"议论文","sentences":[{"en":"Understanding traditional Chinese culture is valuable for young people.","zh":"理解中华传统文化对年轻人很有价值。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"It helps us learn about the customs and ideas that have shaped our communities.","zh":"它帮助我们了解那些塑造了我们所在群体的习俗与思想。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["customs and ideas"]},{"en":"It also gives us useful knowledge when we communicate with people from different cultural backgrounds.","zh":"当我们与来自不同文化背景的人交流时，它也能为我们提供有用的知识。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["different cultural backgrounds"]},{"en":"First, learning about traditional culture helps us understand the meaning behind familiar practices.","zh":"首先，学习传统文化帮助我们理解熟悉习俗背后的意义。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["the meaning behind familiar practices"]},{"en":"For example, the Spring Festival is an opportunity to learn how family gatherings express care and connection.","zh":"例如，春节让我们有机会了解家庭团聚如何表达关爱与联结。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["care and connection"]},{"en":"Understanding these meanings makes traditions more relevant to our lives.","zh":"理解这些含义，可以使传统与我们的生活更加相关。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"Second, cultural knowledge supports communication.","zh":"其次，文化知识有助于交流。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["cultural knowledge supports communication"]},{"en":"When an international student asks about calligraphy or a traditional festival, a clear explanation can help them understand our culture more accurately.","zh":"当一名国际学生询问书法或某个传统节日时，清楚的解释可以帮助对方更准确地理解我们的文化。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"Listening to their customs in return can deepen mutual understanding.","zh":"作为回应，倾听他们的习俗也能加深相互理解。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["deepen mutual understanding"]},{"en":"We should also examine traditions thoughtfully, preserving valuable practices while considering whether they suit modern life.","zh":"我们还应该认真审视传统，在保留有价值的做法的同时，考虑它们是否适合现代生活。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["preserving valuable practices","examine traditions thoughtfully"]},{"en":"To develop this understanding, we can read accessible books, visit museums and speak with people who practice traditional arts.","zh":"要加深这种理解，我们可以阅读通俗易懂的书籍、参观博物馆，并与传统艺术实践者交流。","section":"建议与总结","targets":[]},{"en":"Schools can provide opportunities for students to explore culture through practical activities.","zh":"学校可以为学生提供通过实践活动探索文化的机会。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["practical activities"]},{"en":"By learning and sharing with an open mind, we can pass on cultural knowledge and make exchanges with others more meaningful.","zh":"以开放的心态学习和分享，我们能够传递文化知识，让与他人的交流更有意义。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["with an open mind","pass on cultural knowledge"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"Understanding traditional Chinese culture is valuable for young people. It helps us learn about the customs and ideas that have shaped our communities. It also gives us useful knowledge when we communicate with people from different cultural backgrounds.","zh":"理解中华传统文化对年轻人很有价值。它帮助我们认识塑造所在群体的习俗与思想，也为我们与不同文化背景的人交流提供有用知识。"},{"en":"First, learning about traditional culture helps us understand the meaning behind familiar practices. For example, the Spring Festival is an opportunity to learn how family gatherings express care and connection. Understanding these meanings makes traditions more relevant to our lives. Second, cultural knowledge supports communication. When an international student asks about calligraphy or a traditional festival, a clear explanation can help them understand our culture more accurately. Listening to their customs in return can deepen mutual understanding. We should also examine traditions thoughtfully, preserving valuable practices while considering whether they suit modern life.","zh":"首先，学习传统文化帮助我们理解熟悉习俗背后的意义。例如，春节让我们有机会认识家庭团聚如何表达关爱和联结。理解这些含义，使传统与我们的生活更相关。其次，文化知识支持交流。国际学生询问书法或传统节日时，清楚解释能够帮助他们更准确地理解我们的文化。反过来倾听他们的习俗，也能加深相互理解。我们还应认真审视传统，保留有价值的做法，同时考虑它们是否适合现代生活。"},{"en":"To develop this understanding, we can read accessible books, visit museums and speak with people who practice traditional arts. Schools can provide opportunities for students to explore culture through practical activities. By learning and sharing with an open mind, we can pass on cultural knowledge and make exchanges with others more meaningful.","zh":"要加深理解，我们可以读通俗易懂的书、参观博物馆，并与传统艺术实践者交流。学校可以通过实践活动让学生探索文化。以开放心态学习和分享，能帮助我们传递文化知识，让交流更有意义。"}],"structure":[{"label":"了解习俗与思想","summary":"了解习俗与思想","keywords":["customs and ideas"]},{"label":"理解春节团聚的意义","summary":"理解春节团聚的意义","keywords":["care and connection"]},{"label":"解释文化并相互倾听","summary":"解释文化并相互倾听","keywords":["deepen mutual understanding","preserving valuable practices"]},{"label":"实践学习与开放交流","summary":"实践学习与开放交流","keywords":["practical activities","with an open mind"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet6-07-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet6-07-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-07-01.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-07-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet6-07-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-07-02.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-07-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet6-07-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-07-03.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-07-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet6-07-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-07-04.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672}],"keywords":["different cultural backgrounds","deepen mutual understanding","preserving valuable practices","with an open mind","customs and ideas","the meaning behind familiar practices","care and connection","cultural knowledge supports communication","examine traditions thoughtfully","practical activities","pass on cultural knowledge"],"transferTip":"写文化交流时突出双向理解；写文化保护时增加记录、教学与传承措施；写方言保护时，需要专门论证地方认同和语言多样性。"},{"id":"cet6-08","level":"CET6","number":8,"title":"心理健康与生活平衡","titleEn":"Mental Health and a Balanced Life","genre":"议论文","sentences":[{"en":"Mental health deserves attention alongside physical health.","zh":"心理健康应当与身体健康一样受到重视。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"College students often face pressure from exams, relationships and decisions about the future.","zh":"大学生经常面临来自考试、人际关系和未来选择的压力。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"Learning to manage this pressure can help us study effectively and enjoy a more balanced university life.","zh":"学会管理这些压力，可以帮助我们有效学习，并享受更加平衡的大学生活。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["a more balanced university life"]},{"en":"One common problem is constant comparison with others.","zh":"一个常见问题是不断与他人比较。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["constant comparison with others"]},{"en":"On social media, people usually share their achievements and happy moments, which may give an incomplete picture of their lives.","zh":"在社交媒体上，人们通常分享自己的成就和快乐时刻，这可能无法完整呈现他们的生活。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["an incomplete picture"]},{"en":"Comparing ourselves with these images can lead to unnecessary worry.","zh":"拿自己与这些画面比较，可能带来不必要的担忧。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["unnecessary worry"]},{"en":"Another problem is leaving too little time for rest.","zh":"另一个问题是留给休息的时间太少。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["too little time for rest"]},{"en":"For example, a student who studies late every night may find it harder to concentrate the next day.","zh":"例如，一名每晚学习到很晚的学生，可能会发现自己第二天更难集中注意力。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["concentrate the next day"]},{"en":"A balanced routine can leave more energy for learning and daily activities.","zh":"平衡的作息能够为学习和日常活动保留更多精力。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"Talking with a trusted friend can also help us express our feelings and see difficulties from a different perspective.","zh":"与可信赖的朋友交谈，也有助于我们表达感受，并从不同角度看待困难。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["from a different perspective","express our feelings"]},{"en":"To protect our mental health, we should set realistic expectations, keep regular sleeping hours and make time for activities we enjoy.","zh":"为保护心理健康，我们应该设定合理的期待、保持规律的睡眠时间，并为喜欢的活动留出时间。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["set realistic expectations"]},{"en":"If distress continues or affects daily life, we should seek professional support.","zh":"如果困扰持续存在或影响日常生活，我们应该寻求专业支持。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["seek professional support"]},{"en":"Paying attention to our emotional needs can help us respond to challenges more calmly and maintain healthier relationships.","zh":"关注自己的情绪需求，可以帮助我们更平静地应对挑战，并维持更健康的人际关系。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["maintain healthier relationships"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"Mental health deserves attention alongside physical health. College students often face pressure from exams, relationships and decisions about the future. Learning to manage this pressure can help us study effectively and enjoy a more balanced university life.","zh":"心理健康应和身体健康一起受到重视。大学生经常面临考试、人际关系和未来选择带来的压力。学会管理压力，有助于有效学习并享受更平衡的大学生活。"},{"en":"One common problem is constant comparison with others. On social media, people usually share their achievements and happy moments, which may give an incomplete picture of their lives. Comparing ourselves with these images can lead to unnecessary worry. Another problem is leaving too little time for rest. For example, a student who studies late every night may find it harder to concentrate the next day. A balanced routine can leave more energy for learning and daily activities. Talking with a trusted friend can also help us express our feelings and see difficulties from a different perspective.","zh":"一个常见问题是不断与他人比较。在社交媒体上，人们通常分享成就和快乐时刻，这可能不能完整呈现他们的生活。拿自己和这些画面比较，会带来不必要的担忧。另一个问题是休息时间过少。例如，每晚学习到很晚的学生，第二天可能更难集中注意力。平衡的作息能为学习和日常活动保留更多精力。与可信赖的朋友交谈，也有助于表达感受，从不同角度看待困难。"},{"en":"To protect our mental health, we should set realistic expectations, keep regular sleeping hours and make time for activities we enjoy. If distress continues or affects daily life, we should seek professional support. Paying attention to our emotional needs can help us respond to challenges more calmly and maintain healthier relationships.","zh":"为保护心理健康，我们应设定合理期待，保持规律睡眠，并为喜欢的活动留出时间。如果困扰持续或影响日常生活，应寻求专业支持。关注情绪需求，能帮助我们更平静地应对挑战，维持更健康的人际关系。"}],"structure":[{"label":"大学压力","summary":"大学压力","keywords":["a more balanced university life"]},{"label":"社交比较与休息不足","summary":"社交比较与休息不足","keywords":["constant comparison with others","too little time for rest"]},{"label":"平衡作息和倾诉","summary":"平衡作息和倾诉","keywords":["express our feelings","from a different perspective"]},{"label":"合理期待与必要支持","summary":"合理期待与必要支持","keywords":["set realistic expectations","seek professional support"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet6-08-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet6-08-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-08-01.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-08-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet6-08-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-08-02.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-08-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet6-08-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-08-03.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-08-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet6-08-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-08-04.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672}],"keywords":["an incomplete picture","concentrate the next day","from a different perspective","seek professional support","a more balanced university life","constant comparison with others","unnecessary worry","too little time for rest","express our feelings","set realistic expectations","maintain healthier relationships"],"transferTip":"写容貌焦虑时，把主体改为对外表的比较与单一审美；写工作休闲平衡时，重点改为时间安排和边界；本篇不能直接用于家庭教育题。"},{"id":"cet6-09","level":"CET6","number":9,"title":"环保的生活方式","titleEn":"An Environmentally Friendly Lifestyle","genre":"议论文","sentences":[{"en":"An environmentally friendly lifestyle begins with choices we make every day.","zh":"环保的生活方式始于我们每天作出的选择。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["choices we make every day"]},{"en":"Although one person's actions may seem small, daily habits can affect the amount of waste and pollution we produce.","zh":"虽然一个人的行动可能看似微小，日常习惯却会影响我们产生的垃圾和污染的数量。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"College students can contribute by making practical changes in campus life.","zh":"大学生可以通过校园生活中的实际改变作出贡献。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["practical changes in campus life"]},{"en":"First, reducing unnecessary consumption helps save resources.","zh":"首先，减少不必要的消费有助于节约资源。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["reducing unnecessary consumption"]},{"en":"For example, bringing a reusable bottle can reduce the need to buy drinks in disposable containers.","zh":"例如，随身携带可重复使用的水瓶，可以减少购买一次性容器装饮料的需要。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["disposable containers","a reusable bottle"]},{"en":"Repairing useful items instead of replacing them immediately can also prevent waste.","zh":"维修仍有用的物品，而不是立即更换它们，也能够避免浪费。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["prevent waste"]},{"en":"Second, choosing suitable transport can reduce pollution.","zh":"其次，选择合适的交通方式可以减少污染。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["reduce pollution"]},{"en":"Walking or cycling for short journeys is often convenient and gives us a chance to exercise.","zh":"短途步行或骑行通常很方便，也能给我们提供锻炼的机会。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"However, personal effort is easier to maintain when the environment supports it.","zh":"不过，当环境提供支持时，个人的努力会更容易持续。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"Clearly labeled recycling bins and convenient public transport can make environmentally friendly choices more accessible.","zh":"标识清楚的回收桶和便利的公共交通，可以让环保选择更容易实现。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["make environmentally friendly choices more accessible"]},{"en":"Schools can also explain how these choices work and help students participate in practical activities.","zh":"学校还可以解释这些选择如何起作用，并帮助学生参与实践活动。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"We should begin with habits that are realistic for our circumstances and maintain them consistently.","zh":"我们应该从适合自身情况的习惯开始，并持续保持这些习惯。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["maintain them consistently"]},{"en":"Universities and local authorities can support these efforts by improving facilities and providing clear guidance.","zh":"大学和地方管理部门可以通过改善设施、提供清晰指导，来支持这些努力。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["improving facilities"]},{"en":"When practical support meets individual responsibility, environmentally friendly living can become a regular part of everyday life.","zh":"当实际支持与个人责任相结合时，环保生活就能成为日常生活的固定组成部分。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["individual responsibility"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"An environmentally friendly lifestyle begins with choices we make every day. Although one person's actions may seem small, daily habits can affect the amount of waste and pollution we produce. College students can contribute by making practical changes in campus life.","zh":"环保生活始于每天的选择。一个人的行动看似微小，日常习惯却会影响我们产生的垃圾与污染数量。大学生可以通过校园生活中的实际改变作出贡献。"},{"en":"First, reducing unnecessary consumption helps save resources. For example, bringing a reusable bottle can reduce the need to buy drinks in disposable containers. Repairing useful items instead of replacing them immediately can also prevent waste. Second, choosing suitable transport can reduce pollution. Walking or cycling for short journeys is often convenient and gives us a chance to exercise. However, personal effort is easier to maintain when the environment supports it. Clearly labeled recycling bins and convenient public transport can make environmentally friendly choices more accessible. Schools can also explain how these choices work and help students participate in practical activities.","zh":"首先，减少不必要的消费有助于节约资源。例如，自带可重复使用的水瓶，可以减少购买一次性包装饮料的需要。维修仍有用的物品，而不是立即更换，也能避免浪费。其次，选择合适交通方式可以减少污染。短途步行或骑行通常方便，也提供运动机会。不过，环境支持会让个人努力更容易持续。标识清楚的回收桶和便利的公共交通，可以让环保选择更容易实现。学校也可以解释这些选择如何起作用，并帮助学生参与实践活动。"},{"en":"We should begin with habits that are realistic for our circumstances and maintain them consistently. Universities and local authorities can support these efforts by improving facilities and providing clear guidance. When practical support meets individual responsibility, environmentally friendly living can become a regular part of everyday life.","zh":"我们应从适合自身情况的习惯开始并持续保持。大学和地方管理部门可以改善设施、提供明确指导。实际支持与个人责任相结合，能让环保生活成为日常的一部分。"}],"structure":[{"label":"日常选择影响浪费","summary":"日常选择影响浪费","keywords":["choices we make every day"]},{"label":"减少消费与绿色出行","summary":"减少消费与绿色出行","keywords":["reducing unnecessary consumption","reduce pollution"]},{"label":"设施让行动更容易","summary":"设施让行动更容易","keywords":["make environmentally friendly choices more accessible"]},{"label":"持续习惯和共同支持","summary":"持续习惯和共同支持","keywords":["maintain them consistently","improving facilities"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet6-09-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet6-09-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-09-01.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-09-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet6-09-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-09-02.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-09-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet6-09-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-09-03.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-09-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet6-09-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-09-04.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672}],"keywords":["reducing unnecessary consumption","disposable containers","make environmentally friendly choices more accessible","improving facilities","choices we make every day","practical changes in campus life","a reusable bottle","prevent waste","reduce pollution","maintain them consistently","individual responsibility"],"transferTip":"写绿色出行时重点展开交通选择；写环保习惯兴起的原因时，应改成环保意识、设施条件和教育等原因；写热爱自然时，应补充亲近自然的价值。"},{"id":"cet6-10","level":"CET6","number":10,"title":"个人成长与国家发展","titleEn":"Personal Growth and National Development","genre":"议论文","sentences":[{"en":"Young people can pursue personal growth while contributing to national development.","zh":"年轻人可以在追求个人成长的同时，为国家发展作出贡献。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"Progress in fields such as education and technology creates opportunities to learn and work.","zh":"教育、技术等领域的进步创造了学习和工作的机会。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":[]},{"en":"For college students, making good use of these opportunities means developing useful abilities and understanding the needs of society.","zh":"对于大学生来说，充分利用这些机会意味着培养有用的能力，并理解社会的需求。","section":"提出问题与立论","targets":["making good use of these opportunities","understanding the needs of society"]},{"en":"First, solid knowledge and practical skills allow us to contribute more effectively.","zh":"首先，扎实的知识和实践技能使我们能够更有效地作出贡献。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["solid knowledge and practical skills"]},{"en":"For example, a student studying software engineering can develop a simple tool that helps classmates organize learning materials.","zh":"例如，一名学习软件工程的学生可以开发一个简单工具，帮助同学整理学习资料。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"The project provides experience while addressing a real need.","zh":"这个项目在回应真实需求的同时，也提供了实践经验。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["addressing a real need"]},{"en":"Second, involvement in community life helps us discover problems beyond our own interests.","zh":"其次，参与社区生活有助于我们发现超出个人兴趣范围的问题。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["involvement in community life"]},{"en":"Volunteer activities and conversations with different people can show us where our knowledge may be useful.","zh":"志愿活动以及与不同人的交谈，能够让我们看到自己的知识在哪些地方可能有用。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":[]},{"en":"These experiences can also guide our future choices, helping us find work that matches both our strengths and the needs of others.","zh":"这些经历也可以指导我们未来的选择，帮助我们找到既符合自身优势、又回应他人需求的工作。","section":"解释、例证与论证","targets":["guide our future choices"]},{"en":"We should therefore take our studies seriously and look for practical opportunities to apply what we learn.","zh":"因此，我们应该认真对待学业，寻找应用所学知识的实践机会。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["apply what we learn","take our studies seriously"]},{"en":"Meaningful contributions can begin with small projects that improve everyday life.","zh":"有意义的贡献可以从改善日常生活的小项目开始。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["improve everyday life"]},{"en":"By developing our abilities and using them responsibly, we can work towards personal goals and play a constructive role in our country's development.","zh":"通过发展能力并负责任地使用这些能力，我们能够努力实现个人目标，在国家发展中发挥建设性作用。","section":"建议与总结","targets":["play a constructive role","using them responsibly"]}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"Young people can pursue personal growth while contributing to national development. Progress in fields such as education and technology creates opportunities to learn and work. For college students, making good use of these opportunities means developing useful abilities and understanding the needs of society.","zh":"年轻人可以在追求个人成长的同时，为国家发展作出贡献。教育、技术等领域的进步创造了学习和工作的机会。大学生要利用好这些机会，就需要培养有用的能力并理解社会需求。"},{"en":"First, solid knowledge and practical skills allow us to contribute more effectively. For example, a student studying software engineering can develop a simple tool that helps classmates organize learning materials. The project provides experience while addressing a real need. Second, involvement in community life helps us discover problems beyond our own interests. Volunteer activities and conversations with different people can show us where our knowledge may be useful. These experiences can also guide our future choices, helping us find work that matches both our strengths and the needs of others.","zh":"首先，扎实知识和实践技能让我们能够更有效地贡献力量。例如，软件工程学生可以开发一个简单工具，帮助同学整理学习资料。这个项目既提供实践经验，也回应真实需求。其次，参与社区生活帮助我们发现超出个人兴趣的问题。志愿活动以及与不同人交谈，可以让我们看到知识在哪里有用。这些经历也能指导未来选择，帮助我们找到同时符合自身优势和他人需求的工作。"},{"en":"We should therefore take our studies seriously and look for practical opportunities to apply what we learn. Meaningful contributions can begin with small projects that improve everyday life. By developing our abilities and using them responsibly, we can work towards personal goals and play a constructive role in our country's development.","zh":"因此，我们应认真学习，寻找应用所学的实践机会。有意义的贡献可以从改善日常生活的小项目开始。发展能力并负责任地使用它们，能让我们努力实现个人目标，在国家发展中发挥建设性作用。"}],"structure":[{"label":"发展带来机会","summary":"发展带来机会","keywords":["making good use of these opportunities"]},{"label":"技能解决真实需求","summary":"技能解决真实需求","keywords":["solid knowledge and practical skills","addressing a real need"]},{"label":"社区参与发现问题","summary":"社区参与发现问题","keywords":["involvement in community life","guide our future choices"]},{"label":"学习并实践贡献","summary":"学习并实践贡献","keywords":["apply what we learn","play a constructive role"]}],"images":[{"id":"cet6-10-01","kind":"逐句拆解","src":"assets/cet6-10-01.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-10-01.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-10-02","kind":"结构解析","src":"assets/cet6-10-02.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-10-02.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-10-03","kind":"记忆导图","src":"assets/cet6-10-03.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-10-03.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672},{"id":"cet6-10-04","kind":"主题迁移","src":"assets/cet6-10-04.webp","thumb":"assets/cet6-10-04.thumb.webp","width":941,"height":1672}],"keywords":["making good use of these opportunities","addressing a real need","apply what we learn","play a constructive role","understanding the needs of society","solid knowledge and practical skills","involvement in community life","guide our future choices","take our studies seriously","improve everyday life","using them responsibly"],"transferTip":"可用于青年担当和个人价值类题目。写中国梦时，应围绕题目给出的具体观点展开；图表题必须补写实际图中时间、单位与关键数据，不能照搬本篇开头。"}]};
